	["{area:159} is a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers: {npc:1738} stands by the road into town, {npc:1518} in the apothecary's house on the west side of the square."] = "从飞艇塔沿路向北走一小段就是{area:159}：{npc:1738}站在进城的路边，{npc:1518}在广场西侧的药剂师屋里。",
