	["{area:228} is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance; {npc:2226}, the bat handler, is just east of it.\nSwim back and follow the road west to the {area:228}."] = "{area:228}是森林中央的被遗忘者墓穴小镇。你需要找的人都站在墓穴入口周围；蝙蝠管理员{npc:2226}就在入口东边。\n游回来，沿路向西前往{area:228}。",
