	["{npc:10377}, by the wind rider master"] = "{npc:10377}，在双足飞龙管理员旁边",
	["{npc:10428}'s next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in {zone:1456}, off this route. Skip it."] = "{npc:10428}的下一个任务（生命圣火）在{zone:1456}结束，不在本路线上。跳过它。",
	["{npc:10617}'s {quest:4881}, if you meet him"] = "{npc:10617}的{quest:4881}，如果你遇到他",
	["{npc:10645}, inside"] = "{npc:10645}：在屋内",
	["{npc:11116}, beside {npc:4877}"] = "{npc:11116}，在{npc:4877}旁边",
	["{npc:12196}, beside her"] = "{npc:12196}，在她旁边",
	["{npc:12676}, a big nightsaber, prowls the same woods further east, on the way north to Splintertree. Her claw starts the next hunt quest."] = "{npc:12676} 是一只巨大的夜刃豹，在同一片树林更东边徘徊，位于向北通往碎木岗哨的路上。她的爪子可以触发下一个狩猎任务。",
	["{npc:12676}, a big nightsaber, prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp, on the way north to Splintertree. Her claw starts the next hunt quest."] = "{npc:12676} 是一只巨大的夜刃豹，在战歌伐木营地东南面的树林中徘徊，位于向北通往碎木岗哨的路上。她的爪子可以触发下一个狩猎任务。",
	["{npc:12676}, a big nightsaber, prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp. Her claw starts the next hunt quest."] = "{npc:12676}是一只巨大的夜刃豹，在战歌伐木营地东南的树林里潜行。它的爪子可以开始下一个狩猎任务。",
	["{npc:12677}, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around {area:426}, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest."] = "{npc:12677}是一只暗影豹，在魔草萨特营地西边的{area:426}周围的树林里潜行。它的头颅可以开始下一个狩猎任务。",
	["{npc:12696} keeps the hunt board at {area:428}, by the flight master: take {quest:6383} and hand it straight back. {npc:12678}, {npc:12676} and {npc:12677} drop their trophies only after it."] = "{npc:12696}在{area:428}的飞行管理员旁边管理狩猎告示板：接下{quest:6383}后立即交还。只有完成它之后，{npc:12678}、{npc:12676}和{npc:12677}才会掉落它们的战利品。",
	["{npc:12696}, once all three hunts are in"] = "{npc:12696}，三个狩猎任务全部交还后",
	["{npc:12717} walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead."] = "{npc:12717}沿着海滩向北走到一个纳迦火盆旁。熄灭火盆，然后在纳迦一波波来袭时保护他，直到鞭笞者沃尔沙死去。",
	["{npc:12717}: starts his escort at once"] = "{npc:12717}：立即开始护送",
	["{npc:12718}: only if you carry the manual pages"] = "{npc:12718}：仅当你带着手册书页时",
	["{npc:12736} offers a {area:2797} quest next; leave it unless you have a group."] = "{npc:12736}接下来会提供一个{area:2797}任务；除非你有队伍，否则别接。",
	["{npc:12736} stands in the outpost."] = "{npc:12736} 站在前哨站内。",
	["{npc:12759}, a corrupted water elemental, drifts in {area:421}. Her {item:16408} starts a quest for Splintertree."] = "{npc:12759}是一个被腐化的水元素，在{area:421}里漂浮。它掉落的{item:16408}可以开始一个碎木岗哨的任务。",
	["{npc:12818}, below ground"] = "{npc:12818}，地下",
	["{npc:12837}, inside"] = "{npc:12837}，在里面",
	["{npc:210995} may not offer these to every class; if he doesn't, carry on.; walks around {area:1276}: the map marks where to look"] = "{npc:210995}可能不会对每个职业提供这些任务，若没有就继续。；他在{area:1276}一带走动：地图上标出了查看位置",
	["{npc:210995} walks around the {area:1276}: the map marks where to look"] = "{npc:210995}在{area:1276}一带走动：地图上标了该找的位置",
	["{npc:210995}, a Forever addition, stands on the west shore of {area:421} with three quick Dragonslayer quests."] = "{npc:210995}是无限新增的NPC，站在{area:421}西岸，有三个简短的屠龙者任务。",
	["{npc:259118} offers {quest:96261} only once {quest:96259} is handed in."] = "{npc:259118}只有在{quest:96259}交还后才会提供{quest:96261}。",
	["{npc:259118}: {quest:96261} comes once this is handed in"] = "{npc:259118}：交还这个任务后会提供{quest:96261}",
	["{npc:264082} sits at the north end of {area:17044}; her {item:273658} starts {quest:96294}. {npc:264082} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:264082} 位于 {area:17044} 北端；她的 {item:273658} 可以开启 {quest:96294}。{npc:264082} 是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:2986} offers {quest:1151} once {quest:1150} is in"] = "交还 {quest:1150} 后，{npc:2986} 才会提供 {quest:1151}",
	["{npc:2986} stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the {quest:1149}, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely."] = "{npc:2986}站在加拉克营地东边的一座石柱顶上。做{quest:1149}时，从他旁边的木板尽头走下去：你会安全落地。",
	["{npc:2986}'s mesa is north-east of Freewind."] = "{npc:2986} 所在的台地在乱风岗东北侧。",
	["{npc:2986}, below ground"] = "{npc:2986}：在地下",
	["{npc:3024} stands beside {npc:4721}, east of {npc:2995}."] = "{npc:3024}站在{npc:4721}旁边，位于{npc:2995}东边。",
	["{npc:4454}: his letter goes to Martek in the {zone:1418}, around level 38"] = "{npc:4454}：他的信要交给{zone:1418}的马特克，大约38级时",
	["{npc:4499}, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of {area:482}, back west past {area:2237}. {npc:4499} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:4499} 是一只攻击很重的岩石元素，在向西经过 {area:2237} 后的 {area:482} 悬崖间巡逻。{npc:4499} 是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:4499}, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of {area:482}. {npc:4499} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:4499}是一个攻击力很高的石元素，在{area:482}的悬崖上走动。{npc:4499}是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:4721} stands a short walk east of {npc:2995}."] = "{npc:4721}站在{npc:2995}东边不远处。",
	["{npc:4721}: {npc:4722} at {area:484}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:4721}：交给{area:484}的{npc:4722}，在本指南后面",
	["{npc:4722} stands in {area:484}: {npc:4721}'s filled phial is for him."] = "{npc:4722}站在{area:484}：{npc:4721}装满的药瓶要交给他。",
	["{npc:4722}: the {object:20807} in {area:1557}, among the Galak camps"] = "{npc:4722}：{area:1557}中的{object:20807}，在加拉克营地之间",
	["{npc:4877}, inside"] = "{npc:4877}：在屋内",
	["{npc:4877}, the trade supplies vendor: the Screeching harpies of {area:487}; inside"] = "{npc:4877}，补给品商人：{area:487}的尖啸鹰身人；在里面",
	["{npc:4877}, the trade supplies vendor: the Screeching harpies of {area:487}; inside the inn"] = "{npc:4877}，商业用品商人：{area:487}的尖啸的鹰身人；在旅店里",
	["{npc:4877}: her stolen supplies lie in the same harpy den"] = "{npc:4877}：她被偷的物资也在同一处鹰身人巢穴",
	["{npc:5899}'s hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole south of {area:378}, on the road to the {area:485}."] = "{npc:5899}的小屋在{area:378}南边野猪人水坑上方的山脊上，就在通往{area:485}的路上。",
	["{object:176344}, north-west camp"] = "{object:176344}，西北营地",
	["{object:176344}, south-east camp"] = "{object:176344}，东南营地",
	["{object:176344}, south-west camp"] = "{object:176344}，西南营地",
	["{object:19868} lies all over the flats north of the raceway. Scorpid Reavers roam the north half; keep to it, away from the Saltstone Basilisks, Crystalhides and Gazers (32-35) west of the track, in the middle and the far south."] = "{object:19868}散布在赛道以北的平地上。蝎子掠夺者游荡在北半部；就待在那片区域，远离赛道以西、中间和远南方向32-35级的盐石蜥蜴、水晶皮蜥蜴和凝视者。",
	["{object:3646}; below ground"] = "{object:3646}：在地下",
	["{quest:98069}, on the ground around the den"] = "{quest:98069}，在巢穴周围的地面上",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1456}'s central rise"] = "{zone:1456}的中央高台",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills"] = {
	["Back east to {area:272}."] = "向东回到{area:272}。",
	["Back into the yeti caves west of {area:272} with the {item:3710}. The path splits just inside: the {object:1768} burns on the upper level to the right, the {object:1769} on the lower level to the left, past more yetis."] = "带上 {item:3710}，回到 {area:272} 西侧的雪人洞穴。刚进洞就有岔路：{object:1768} 在右侧上层，{object:1769} 在左侧下层，需穿过更多雪人。",
	["Back north to {area:321}."] = "向北返回 {area:321}。",
	["Back to the fields: the Peasants work south of the farmhouses. Careful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back adds; snares or roots keep them from escaping."] = "回到农田：农民在农舍南边干活。小心：逃跑的农民如果跑到镇公所，可能会带回更多敌人；用减速或定身可以阻止他们逃跑。",
	["Back to {area:272}"] = "返回{area:272}",
	["Back to {area:272}."] = "返回{area:272}。",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Blacksmith Verringtan"] = "铁匠维林坦",
	["Boulderfist Enforcer"] = "石拳执行者",
	["Boulderfist Ogre"] = "石拳食人魔",
	["Boulderfist camp"] = "石拳营地",
	["Captain Ironhill"] = "铁山队长",
	["Citizen Wilkes"] = "平民维尔克斯",
	["Clear {area:290} from the gate in; the dwarves run for help at 30% health."] = "从大门开始向内清理 {area:290}；矮人会在生命值降到 30% 时逃跑求援。",
	["Clerk Horrace Whitesteed"] = "书记员霍勒斯·怀特斯蒂德",
	["Crossroads flight master"] = "十字路口飞行管理员",
	["Daggerspine naga"] = "刺脊纳迦",
	["Daggerspine shore"] = "刺脊海岸",
	["Darthalia's last battle is at {area:290}, the dwarven keep south-east of {area:271}: every dwarf there is elite (28-32), {npc:2304} too. Great XP if you have a group for it."] = "达萨利亚的最后一战在 {area:290}，即 {area:271} 东南侧的矮人要塞：那里所有矮人都是精英（28-32 级），{npc:2304} 也是。有队伍的话，经验很丰厚。",
	["Drull's ball and chain"] = "德鲁尔的镣铐",
	["Dun Garok Mountaineer"] = "丹加洛克巡山人",
	["Dun Garok Priest"] = "丹加洛克牧师",
	["Dun Garok Rifleman"] = "丹加洛克火枪手",
	["Farmer Getz"] = "农夫盖兹",
	["Farmer Kalaba"] = "农夫卡拉巴",
	["Farmer Ray"] = "农夫雷恩",
	["Fly from {area:484} to {area:1638} and train with {npc:3033} on {area:1639}; fly on to the Crossroads from there."] = "从 {area:484} 飞往 {area:1638}，到 {area:1639} 找 {npc:3033} 学习技能；再从那里飞往十字路口。",
	["Fly from {area:484} to {area:392}. {npc:5901} camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to the Crossroads from {area:392}."] = "从 {area:484} 飞往 {area:392}。{npc:5901} 在镇子南边不远的海岸扎营；随后从 {area:392} 飞往十字路口。",
	["Fly to the Crossroads"] = "飞往十字路口",
	["Fly to the {area:228}. The {object:113791} stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the {npc:5895} and keep the {item:7813} for {npc:5901}. Fly on to {area:272} from the {area:228}."] = "飞往 {area:228}。{object:113791} 位于其西南侧的山坡上：击败旁边的堕落的水之魂，将其护腕放入火盆，与 {npc:5895} 交谈，并保留 {item:7813}，之后交给 {npc:5901}。再从 {area:228} 飞往 {area:272}。",
	["Fly to {area:1497}"] = "飞往{area:1497}",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:272}"] = "飞往{area:272}",
	["Follow the road north out of {area:272} into the Alterac foothills. {quest:535} waits by the Syndicate camp. He offers his errand only while you carry {npc:2229}'s Infiltration: hand him the stout at once, and his reward is the Syndicate Missive Krusk wants."] = "沿道路向北离开{area:272}，进入奥特兰克山麓。{quest:535}在辛迪加营地旁等候。只有当你带着{npc:2229}的潜入任务时，他才会给你这趟差事：马上把烈酒交给他，他回赠的正是克鲁斯克想要的辛迪加信件。",
	["Follow the road north out of {area:272} into the Alterac foothills. {quest:535} waits by the Syndicate camp; hand him the stout."] = "沿道路向北离开{area:272}，进入奥特兰克山麓。{quest:535}在辛迪加营地旁等候；把南海镇烈酒交给他。",
	["For characters of 29 to 33, but most quests here are level 32-34, a few up to 36: on purpose, for their experience. The Syndicate, {area:279}'s guards and the Boulderfist ogres are 31-35, so pull them one at a time."] = "适合29到33级的角色，但这里的大多数任务是32-34级，少数高达36级：这是有意安排的，为了它们的经验值。辛迪加、{area:279}的守卫和石拳食人魔为31-35级，所以一次拉一只。",
	["Foreman Bonds"] = "工头邦兹",
	["From {area:271} head north past {area:272} and follow the road on into the Alterac foothills. {quest:535} waits by the Syndicate camp. He offers his errand only while you carry {npc:2229}'s Infiltration: hand him the stout at once, and his reward is the Syndicate Missive Krusk wants. A missive from the Syndicate here does the same: with one in your bags the guide passes {quest:535}."] = "从{area:271}向北经过{area:272}，沿道路一直走进奥特兰克山麓。{quest:535}在辛迪加营地旁等着。只有你身上带着{npc:2229}的“秘密潜入”时，他才会给出差事：立刻把酒交给他，他的奖励就是克鲁斯克要的辛迪加信件。从这里的辛迪加身上拿到的信件也一样：背包里有一封，指南就会跳过{quest:535}。",
	["Head back north to {area:272}, east of {area:271}."] = "向北返回 {area:272}，位于 {area:271} 东侧。",
	["Head back north to {area:272}."] = "向北返回{area:272}。",
	["Head back south down the road to {area:272}."] = "沿道路向南返回{area:272}。",
	["Head east out of {area:272} through {area:1057} and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south of {area:313}; the Enforcers stay in the cave there."] = "从{area:272}向东穿过{area:1057}，沿路向东。石拳食人魔和执行者（32-34级）在路南、{area:313}以南扎营；执行者待在那里的洞里。",
	["Head east out of {area:272} through {area:1057} and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south-east of {area:313}."] = "向东穿过{area:1057}出{area:272}，沿路向东。石拳食人魔和石拳执行者（32-34级）在路以南、{area:313}东南扎营。",
	["Head east to {area:271}'s graveyard, on the north-east edge of the town: Helcular's grave lies among the others. Come at it from the north and keep away from the town's guards."] = "向东前往{area:271}的墓地，就在镇子东北边缘：赫尔库拉的坟墓就在其他墓之间。从北边靠近，避开镇上的卫兵。",
	["Head east to {area:271}'s graveyard, on the north-east edge of the town: Helcular's grave lies among the others. Come at it from the north, down the slope above the town. Southshore Guards (55) stand at the graveyard's north-west corner and south-east of the grave: walk in between them, hand the quest in and leave the way you came."] = "向东前往{area:271}东北边缘的墓地：赫尔库拉的坟墓就在其中。从北侧沿镇子上方的山坡下来接近。南海镇卫兵（55级）站在墓地西北角和坟墓东南方：从他们中间走进去，交还任务后原路离开。",
	["Head south past {area:287} town to the {area:288}. Miners work the tunnels; {npc:2305} (30) and {npc:2450} (29) are deep inside."] = "向南穿过 {area:287} 镇，前往 {area:288}。矿工在隧道内作业；{npc:2305}（30 级）和 {npc:2450}（29 级）在深处。",
	["Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of {area:279}. {npc:2411}, {npc:2412} and {npc:2413} (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, {npc:2414} (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-32) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens.\nCareful: Many guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone around the camp."] = "沿山脚向西前往{area:279}的紫罗兰色穹顶。{npc:2411}、{npc:2412}和{npc:2413}（33-34级）一起站在环形山口的东缘内，{npc:2414}（35级）在他们西边一点；每人各带一块血石碎片。周围的盾卫和神术师（31-32级）掉落磨损的石质徽记。\n注意：许多守卫成对联动站位，其余则单独在营地周围巡逻。",
	["Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of {area:279}. {npc:2411}, {npc:2412} and {npc:2413} (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, {npc:2414} (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-33) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens. Careful: Many guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone around the camp."] = "沿山脚向西到{area:279}的紫色圆顶。{npc:2411}、{npc:2412}和{npc:2413}（33-34级）一起站在环形坑东缘内侧，{npc:2414}（35级）在他们稍西；每人身上带一块血石碎片。他们周围的盾卫和神学家（31-33级）掉磨损的石制符记。注意：很多守卫成对连在一起，另一些单独在营地周围巡逻。",
	["Highland raptors and Plains Creepers"] = "高地迅猛龙和平原狼蛛",
	["Hillsbrad Apprentice Blacksmith"] = "希尔斯布莱德见习铁匠",
	["Hillsbrad Councilman"] = "希尔斯布莱德议员",
	["Hillsbrad Farmer"] = "希尔斯布莱德农夫",
	["Hillsbrad Farmhand"] = "希尔斯布莱德雇农",
	["Hillsbrad Miner"] = "希尔斯布莱德矿工",
	["Hillsbrad Peasant"] = "希尔斯布莱德农民",
	["Hillsbrad Peasants"] = "希尔斯布莱德农民",
	["Inside"] = "在里面",
	["Inside {area:288}"] = "在{area:288}里面",
	["Level 30"] = "30 级",
	["Level 31"] = "31 级",
	["Lydon's next errand is a keg of Shindigger Stout from the cellar of {area:290}, the elite dwarven keep south-east of {area:271}: take it only if you go there with a group."] = "莱登的下一个差事是一桶仙迪格烈酒，要从{area:290}的地窖里拿——那是{area:271}东南的精英矮人要塞：只有组队去才接。",
	["Magistrate Burnside"] = "行政官伯恩赛德",
	["Miner Hackett"] = "矿工哈克特",
	["North of Southshore's graveyard"] = "南海镇墓地以北",
	["On the way back north, Highland Striders roam the hills all around {area:321} and drop the eyes, and south of it the Plains Creepers (32-33) spin their webs in the grass; they carry the spidersilk."] = "向北返回的路上，高地阔步龙在 {area:321} 周围的山间游荡，会掉落眼球；南侧的平原狼蛛（32-33 级）在草地间结网，会掉落蛛丝。",
	["On to {area:287} town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: {npc:2335} (30) and {npc:2448} are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town."] = "继续前往雪人洞穴西南边的{area:287}镇。市政厅在镇子西侧：{npc:2335}（30级）和{npc:2448}在里面，旁边是城镇登记簿；公告就贴在它旁边。议员们在镇上走动。",
	["Only if {quest:535}'s missive didn't come your way: the Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-34) around the camps west of the road carry missives too; about one in three drops one."] = "只有{quest:535}的信件没落到你手上时才需要：道路西边营地周围的辛迪加劫匪和辛迪加窃贼（32-34级）也携带信件；大约三分之一会掉落。",
	["Only if {quest:535}'s missive didn't come your way: the Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-34) around the camps west of the road carry missives too; about one in three drops one. Careful: at 31-32 they are still above you and stand close together, with Wizards (34-35) among them: pull one at a time from the camp's edge."] = "只有在没拿到{quest:535}的信件时才做：道路西边营地周围的辛迪加劫匪和窃贼（32-34级）也带着信件，约每三只掉一封。小心：31-32级时它们仍比你高，而且站得很近，其中还有巫师（34-35级）：从营地边缘一次拉一只。",
	["Place the {object:1729} on the {object:1728} beside the inn; upstairs"] = "将 {object:1729} 放到旅店旁楼上的 {object:1728} 上。",
	["Shindigger keg"] = "矿工烈酒酒桶",
	["South of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village. Careful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps."] = "在落锤镇以南，枯木巨魔占据着丘陵里的村子。掷斧手守着外围的棚屋；巫医和猎头者守着村子的中心。注意：这三种巨魔血量降到15%都会逃跑求援，可能拉来附近营地的更多巨魔。",
	["South-east of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village.\nCareful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps."] = "落锤镇东南，枯木巨魔盘踞在丘陵中的村庄里。掷斧者守着外围茅屋，巫医和猎头者占据村子中心。\n小心：这三种巨魔在15%血量时都会逃跑呼救，可能从附近营地引来更多巨魔。",
	["South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and {npc:2238} are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings: {npc:2427} carries the {item:3467} and {npc:2428} the {item:3499}, both in the keep. Kill them, then open both locks."] = "在塔伦米尔东南方。德鲁尔和{npc:2238}被锁在城堡庭院的建筑里：{npc:2427}携带{item:3467}，{npc:2428}携带{item:3499}，两人都在城堡里。杀死他们，然后打开两把锁。",
	["South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-31) fill the {area:277} in the hills west of {area:272}; about one in sixteen carries the rod."] = "在西南，洞穴雪人和凶恶的雪人（30-31级）占满了{area:272}西边山丘里的{area:277}；大约十六分之一带着魔棒。",
	["South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the {area:277} in the hills west of {area:272}; about one in sixteen carries the rod."] = "在西南，洞穴雪人和凶恶的雪人（30-32级）占满了{area:272}西边山丘里的{area:277}；大约十六分之一带着魔棒。",
	["South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the {area:277} in the hills west of {area:272}; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but at 29-30 they hit hard and come in pairs."] = "向西南走，洞穴雪人和凶恶的雪人（30-32 级）遍布 {area:272} 西侧山中的 {area:277}；约每十六只中有一只携带魔棒。待在这片洞穴里：更北边那个洞穴的山岭雪人和巨型雪人（32-34 级）也带着魔棒，但 29-30 级时它们打人很痛，而且成对出现。",
	["Strong Troll's Blood Potion: auction house or an alchemist, for {quest:515}."] = "强力巨魔之血药水：拍卖行或炼金术士，用于{quest:515}。",
	["Syndicate missives"] = "辛迪加信件",
	["The Daggerspine naga line the shore south-east of the town."] = "刺脊纳迦分布在镇子东南侧的海岸上。",
	["The Kegs of Shindigger Stout stand in the cellar of {area:290}, the dwarven keep south-east of {area:271}, beside {npc:2304} (32); every dwarf there is elite (28-32)."] = "仙迪格烈酒桶放在{area:290}的地窖里——那是{area:271}东南的矮人要塞——在{npc:2304}（32级）旁边；那里的每个矮人都是精英（28-32级）。",
	["The Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-33) around the camps west of the road carry the missives; about one in three drops one."] = "道路西边营地周围的辛迪加劫匪和辛迪加窃贼（32-33级）携带信件；大约三分之一会掉落。",
	["The Torn Fin murlocs camp on the beaches south-west of {area:271}'s bay, below the mine."] = "碎鳍鱼人在 {area:271} 海湾西南侧、矿洞下方的沙滩扎营。",
	["The keg stands with a few others at the Syndicate camp on the south-east coast of {area:287}."] = "酒桶和另外几个酒桶一起放在{area:287}东南海岸的辛迪加营地里。",
	["The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. {npc:2851}, the wind rider master, stands by the gate."] = "道路东端的兽人要塞。双足飞龙管理员{npc:2851}站在大门旁。",
	["The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. {npc:2851}, the wind rider master, stands by the gate.\n{npc:15126} offers the {quest:8263} only once you are Friendly with the Defilers ({zone:1461}): skip it if he doesn't offer it."] = "道路东端的兽人要塞。驭风者管理员{npc:2851}站在门口。\n只有你和污染者（{zone:1461}）声望达到友善，{npc:15126}才会给{quest:8263}：他不给就跳过。",
	["The smithy"] = "铁匠铺",
	["The third flame burns in the smaller cave up in the hills north of the caverns."] = "第三处火焰在这些洞穴北侧山上的一个小洞穴里。",
	["The third flame burns in the smaller cave up in the hills north of the caverns.\nCareful: Giant and Mountain Yetis (32-34) stand around the flame, often in pairs, and Frostmaw, a rare yeti (37), roams nearby. At 30-31 they are over your level: pull the yetis one at a time from the cave mouth before you use the Rod, and watch for Frostmaw before you go in."] = "第三团火焰在洞穴群北边山上的小洞穴里燃烧。\n小心：巨型雪人和山岭雪人（32-34级）站在火焰周围，常常成对出现，稀有雪人霜喉雪人（37级）在附近游荡。30-31级时它们比你等级高：使用魔棒前，先从洞口一次拉一只雪人，进去前留意霜喉雪人。",
	["The {area:279} crater"] = "{area:279} 巨坑",
	["The {area:279} crater's eastern rim"] = "{area:279} 巨坑的东侧边缘",
	["Torn Fin beach"] = "碎鳍海滩",
	["Torn Fin murlocs"] = "碎鳍鱼人",
	["Town hall"] = "市政厅",
	["Train"] = "训练",
	["Train while you are in the {zone:1458}: the trainers stand in the {object:36070}, the {object:36073} and the {object:36082} (Paladins: {npc:260093})."] = "趁在{zone:1458}时训练：训练师在{object:36070}、{object:36073}和{object:36082}（圣骑士：{npc:260093}）。",
	["Train your new spells."] = "训练你的新法术。",
	["West across the foothills to {area:287} town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. {npc:2404} and his apprentices work at the forge; the {object:1736} is stacked beside it."] = "向西穿过丘陵前往{area:287}镇：铁匠铺就在镇中央。{npc:2404}和他的学徒在熔炉旁工作；{object:1736}堆在旁边。",
	["West past the hills to the farms east of {area:287} town. {npc:232} works the field by the northern farmhouse, {npc:2403} the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere."] = "向西越过山丘，前往{area:287}镇东边的农场。{npc:232}在北边农舍旁的田里干活，{npc:2403}在更东南边的那片田里；雇农和农夫到处都是。",
	["Witherbark Axe Thrower"] = "枯木掷斧者",
	["Witherbark Headhunter"] = "枯木猎头者",
	["Witherbark Witch Doctor"] = "枯木巫医",
	["You missed Darthalia's first errands, from the 22-25 {area:287} guide: they come first now. They are a few levels below you and quick, and they open the rest of the {quest:527} in this guide."] = "你错过了22-25级{area:287}指南中达萨利亚最早的几个差事：现在先做这些。它们比你低几级，很快就能完成，还会开启本指南中{quest:527}的后续任务。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1458}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1458}",
	["for {npc:2425} in the {zone:1458}, at the end of this guide"] = "交给 {zone:1458} 的 {npc:2425}，在本篇指南结尾完成",
	["for {npc:4483} in the {area:439}, next guide"] = "交给 {area:439} 的 {npc:4483}，见下一篇指南",
	["for {npc:5901}, next guide"] = "交给 {npc:5901}，见下一篇指南",
	["grind on {npc:2248}"] = "击杀 {npc:2248} 刷经验",
	["grind on {npc:2562}"] = "击杀 {npc:2562} 刷经验",
	["{area:228} flight master"] = "{area:228}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:272}'s {quest:544}, {quest:556} and {quest:676} are offered from level 30. Below it? Keep killing the yetis in these caves until level 30. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Graveyard) or the {area:2797} dungeon instead."] = "{area:272} 的 {quest:544}、{quest:556} 和 {quest:676} 从 30 级起可接。还没到？继续击杀这些洞穴里的雪人，直到 30 级。也可组队前往 {area:796} 副本（墓地）或 {area:2797} 副本。",
	["{area:321} flight master"] = "{area:321}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:321}'s quests are 32-36. Below 31? Keep killing the Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers at this camp until level 31. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Graveyard) or the {area:2797} dungeon instead."] = "{area:321} 的任务为 32-36 级。还没到 31 级？继续击杀这处营地里的石拳食人魔和石拳执行者，直到 31 级。也可组队前往 {area:796} 副本（墓地）或 {area:2797} 副本。",
	["{area:392} flight master"] = "{area:392}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:484} flight master"] = "{area:484}的飞行管理员",
	["{item:278225}, from Plains Creepers"] = "{item:278225}，由平原狼蛛掉落",
	["{item:279469}: an object to loot, by the traitors"] = "{item:279469}：一个可拾取的物件，在叛徒那边",
	["{item:3388}: auction house or an alchemist, for {quest:515}."] = "{item:3388}：拍卖行或炼金术士，用于{quest:515}。",
	["{item:3703}, for {npc:2333}"] = "{item:3703}，交给{npc:2333}",
	["{item:6637}: drink it by the standing stone to see the elemental"] = "{item:6637}：在立石旁喝下，就能看见元素",
	["{npc:12920}, at the south gate"] = "{npc:12920}，在南门处",
	["{npc:2216}, inside"] = "{npc:2216}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2229} now offers {npc:2316} (level 36): leave it for the 38-39 visit."] = "{npc:2229} 现在会提供 {npc:2316}（36 级）：留到 38-39 级再来时完成。",
	["{npc:2229} wants his two scouts freed from {area:275} before he trusts you with Infiltration."] = "{npc:2229}要你先把他的两名斥候从{area:275}救出来，然后才会把“秘密潜入”交给你。",
	["{npc:2229}, inside"] = "{npc:2229}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2238}'s ball and chain"] = "{npc:2238}的镣铐",
	["{npc:2410}, inside"] = "{npc:2410}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2410}, inside: offered from level 30"] = "{npc:2410}，在屋内：30 级起可接",
	["{npc:2410}: for the 38-39 visit to Alterac"] = "{npc:2410}：留到 38-39 级前往奥特兰克时完成",
	["{npc:2410}: he offers {quest:545} after it"] = "{npc:2410}：之后他会给{quest:545}",
	["{npc:2410}: {quest:93680}, the {item:279469} is by the traitors"] = "{npc:2410}：{quest:93680}，{item:279469}在叛徒那边",
	["{npc:2419}'s sword drops from the same {area:290} dwarves (about one in twelve)."] = "{npc:2419} 的剑也由 {area:290} 的这些矮人掉落（约十二分之一）。",
	["{npc:2425} stands beside Sylvanas in the {object:36126}."] = "{npc:2425} 站在 {object:36126}，就在希尔瓦娜斯旁边。",
	["{npc:2425}: Darthalia's commendation"] = "{npc:2425}：达萨利亚的表彰",
	["{npc:2437}, inside"] = "{npc:2437}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2437}, inside: offered from level 30"] = "{npc:2437}，在屋内：30 级起可接",
	["{npc:2437}: for the 38-39 visit to Alterac"] = "{npc:2437}：留到 38-39 级前往奥特兰克时完成",
	["{npc:260093} trains Paladins in the {zone:1458}."] = "{npc:260093}在{zone:1458}训练圣骑士。",
	["{npc:2706}'s Guile of the Raptor, {npc:2771}'s next {quest:677} and the doctor's Ward Restocking wait for the 38-39 visit."] = "{npc:2706} 的迅猛龙的狡诈、{npc:2771} 后续的 {quest:677} 和医生的病房补给，都留到 38-39 级再来时完成。",
	["{npc:2706}: its Syndicate are by the road in from {area:272}, on the 38-39 visit"] = "{npc:2706}：所需的辛迪加成员在从 {area:272} 过来的路旁，留到 38-39 级再来时完成",
	["{npc:2770}: for {npc:2771} in {area:321}, later in this guide (from level 30)"] = "{npc:2770}：交给 {area:321} 的 {npc:2771}，在本篇指南后续步骤完成（30 级起可接）",
	["{npc:2792}, by the gate"] = "{npc:2792}，在大门旁",
	["{npc:3428} stands beside the Crossroads flight master."] = "{npc:3428} 就站在十字路口的飞行管理员旁。",
	["{npc:3428}: for {npc:4485} in {zone:1454}"] = "{npc:3428}：交给 {zone:1454} 的 {npc:4485}",
	["{npc:4485} stands in the {object:172958}, on the way out to the main gate."] = "{npc:4485} 站在 {object:172958}，位于出城前往正门的路上。",
	["{npc:4949} waits in Grommash Hold, in the {object:172957}."] = "{npc:4949} 在 {object:172957} 的 Grommash Hold 等候。",
	["{npc:4949}, Grommash Hold, if you carry it"] = "{npc:4949}，在格罗玛什要塞，如果你带着它",
	["{npc:5901}: your {item:6637}, for the brazier"] = "{npc:5901}：你的{item:6637}，用于火盆",
	["{object:1761}, inside"] = "{object:1761}，在里面",
	["{quest:515} needs a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, an {skill:171} item: buy one at the auction house if you can (or ask an alchemist). No potion: skip the Elixir steps in {area:287}."] = "{quest:515}需要一瓶强力巨魔之血药水，这是{skill:171}物品：如果可以，在拍卖行买一瓶（或找炼金术士）。没有药水：跳过{area:287}的药剂步骤。",
	["{quest:515} needs a {item:3388}, an {skill:171} item: buy one at the auction house if you can (or ask an alchemist). The quest text says Strong, but it takes a {item:3388}. No elixir: skip the Elixir steps in {area:287}."] = "{quest:515}需要一个{item:3388}，这是{skill:171}制品：能买就在拍卖行买一个（或者找炼金师）。任务文字写的是“强力”，但它收的是{item:3388}。没有药剂：跳过{area:287}里的药剂步骤。",
	["{quest:515} with a group"] = "{quest:515}，组队去做",
	["{quest:539} with a group"] = "组队完成 {quest:539}",
	["{quest:547} with a group"] = "组队完成 {quest:547}",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1458} flight master"] = "{zone:1458}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1458} trainers"] = "{zone:1458}的训练师",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/02-thousand-needles"] = {
	["Back south to {npc:11863}'s tower."] = "向南返回{npc:11863}所在的高塔。",
	["Back west to {npc:11863}."] = "向西返回{npc:11863}身边。",
	["Clam beds"] = "蚌床",
	["East onto the flats. The Saltstone Basilisks (30-31) sun themselves north-west of it; the Sparkleshell tortoises crowd round a half-buried ship in the north-east, and the Salt Flats Scavengers and Vultures circle the eastern flats. Every vulture drops a bone, about one tortoise in three a shell.\nCareful: Scavengers and Vultures use Execute when your health is low; the Snappers (34-35) hit hardest of the tortoises."] = "向东进入盐碱地。盐石蜥蜴（30-31）在其西北方晒太阳；盐壳海龟聚集在东北方一艘半埋的船旁，盐湖食腐鹫和盐湖秃鹫盘旋在东部盐碱地上空。每只秃鹫都会掉落骨头，海龟约每三只掉一个龟壳。\n小心：盐湖食腐鹫和盐湖秃鹫会在你生命值较低时使用斩杀；盐壳钳嘴龟（34-35）是这些海龟中伤害最高的。",
	["Fly from {zone:1454} to {area:1638} and train with {npc:3033} on {area:1639}; fly on to {area:484} from there."] = "从{zone:1454}飞往{area:1638}，在{area:1639}向{npc:3033}学习技能，再从那里飞往{area:484}。",
	["Fly from {zone:1454} to {area:392}. {npc:5901} camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to {area:484} from {area:392}."] = "从{zone:1454}飞往{area:392}。{npc:5901}的营地在镇子南边不远的海岸上；之后从{area:392}飞往{area:484}。",
	["Fly to {area:460}"] = "飞往{area:460}",
	["Fly to {area:484}"] = "飞往{area:484}",
	["Giant Softshell Clams, on the sea floor"] = "巨型软壳蛤，在海底",
	["Hatefury Betrayer"] = "憎怒背叛者",
	["Hatefury Felsworn"] = "憎怒邪誓者",
	["Hatefury Hellcaller"] = "憎怒唤狱者",
	["Hatefury Rogue"] = "憎怒潜行者",
	["Hatefury Shadowstalker"] = "憎怒暗影潜伏者",
	["Hatefury Trickster"] = "憎怒欺诈者",
	["Head east past {area:599} and along the northern hills to the satyrs' ruins of {area:603}. Kill every kind you meet for {npc:268705}; the Shadowstalkers walk unseen.\nCareful: Hatefury Rogues use Hide when they spawn, so they are stealthed until you find them."] = "向东经过{area:599}，沿北部丘陵前往萨特占据的{area:603}废墟。为{npc:268705}击杀遇到的所有种类；怨怒巡影者会隐身游荡。\n小心：怨怒潜行者刷新时就会使用躲藏，在被发现前一直潜行。",
	["Head east to {area:599}. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the {item:6436} on it before it dies to fill one {item:6435}. The {npc:13019} stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre. The cultists also drop a {item:20310} now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it. {quest:5381}: clear the middle of the largest building, then use the {item:14523} on the red {object:176581} there. A {npc:11876} (37) comes out: kill it for the {item:13542}."] = "向东到{area:599}。把燃烧之刃教徒打残，趁它没死时对它使用{item:6436}，就能填满一个{item:6435}。{npc:13019}带着权杖站在要塞顶层。教徒还会不时掉{item:20310}（1-5%）：掉了就读。{quest:5381}：清空最大那栋楼的中间，然后对那里的红色{object:176581}使用{item:14523}。会出来一个{npc:11876}（37级）：杀了它拿{item:13542}。",
	["Head east to {area:599}. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the {item:6436} on it before it dies to fill one {item:6435}. The {npc:13019} stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre; use the {item:14523} on the {npc:11876} for the {item:13542}. The cultists also drop a {item:20310} now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it."] = "向东前往{area:599}。把一名燃烧之刃信徒打到残血，在它死掉之前对它使用{item:6436}，即可灌满一个{item:6435}。{npc:13019}拿着权杖站在要塞顶层；对{npc:11876}使用{item:14523}，获得{item:13542}。这些信徒偶尔也掉落{item:20310}（1-5%）；如果掉了，读一下。",
	["Head north along the coast, then inland to the ruined tower of {area:2405}: {npc:11863} waits inside. The coast's clams and naga come after {area:599}, on one walk north to {area:2406}."] = "沿海岸向北，再转向内陆前往{area:2405}的废塔：{npc:11863}在塔内等候。海岸上的蚌和纳迦留到{area:599}之后，一路向北前往{area:2406}时再做。",
	["Head north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach; open each clam in your bags for its meat."] = "沿海岸向北走。巨型软壳蚌躺在浅水区，狂暴暗礁爬行者走在海滩上；在背包里打开每个蚌取肉。",
	["Head south out of Stonetalon into {zone:1443} and follow the road south to {npc:11596}'s camp."] = "从石爪山向南进入{zone:1443}，沿路向南前往{npc:11596}的营地。",
	["Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the {area:606} on the way. {npc:268705} stands on the path just north of the village."] = "向西前往海岸边的巨魔村庄，途中避开{area:606}。{npc:268705}就站在村子北边不远处的小路上。",
	["Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the {area:606} on the way. {npc:268705} stands on the path just north of the village.\n{npc:268705} may not be here on Forever: if {npc:268705} doesn't offer {quest:97265}, skip it."] = "向西到海岸边的巨魔村，路上避开{area:606}。{npc:268705}站在村子正北的小路上。\n在 Forever 里{npc:268705}可能不在这里：如果{npc:268705}不给{quest:97265}，跳过。",
	["Keep killing silithid at the dig site for the heart, the talons and the carapaces."] = "继续在挖掘场击杀异种虫，收集心脏、爪子和甲壳。",
	["Keep north to {area:598}. The Slitherblade Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses hold the beach; pull them one at a time."] = "继续向北到{area:598}。滑刃侍从、纳迦和女巫占据着海滩；一次拉一只。",
	["Keep north to {area:598}. The Slitherblade Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses hold the beach; pull them one at a time. Any Slitherblade can drop {item:15881}."] = "继续向北到{area:598}。海滩上有滑刃侍从、滑刃纳迦和滑刃巫师，逐只引来击杀。任何滑刃纳迦都可能掉落{item:15881}。",
	["Level 32.5"] = "32.5级",
	["Level 33"] = "33级",
	["North from the dig to {npc:4483}'s camp on the western edge of the flats."] = "从挖掘场向北，前往盐碱地西缘{npc:4483}的营地。",
	["On the top floor"] = "在最顶层",
	["Run {area:133} with a group when it suits you: {npc:7800} at the end drops his Safe Combination; open his safe behind the northern bomb pillar for the {item:9153}."] = "方便时组队前往{area:133}：最终首领{npc:7800}会掉落他的Safe Combination；用它打开北侧炸弹柱后方的保险箱，取得{item:9153}。",
	["Saltstone Basilisk"] = "盐石蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Crystalhide"] = "水晶皮蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Gazer"] = "凝视者",
	["Scorpashi Lashers"] = "荒土鞭尾蝎",
	["Shadowprey's {quest:5381} and the coast's naga want 33. Below that? The Scorpashi Lashers on the slopes north of {npc:11596}'s camp are on your way west: kill them until level 33. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Library) instead."] = "葬影村的{quest:5381}和海岸上的纳迦需要33级。还没到？向西途中，{npc:11596}营地北边的山坡上有荒土鞭尾蝎，击杀它们直到33级。也可组队挑战{area:796}副本（图书馆）。",
	["Silithid Hive Drone"] = "异种虫巢穴雄蜂",
	["Silithid Invader"] = "异种虫入侵者",
	["Silithid Searcher"] = "异种虫搜寻者",
	["Slitherblade Myrmidon"] = "滑刃侍从",
	["Slitherblade Naga"] = "滑刃纳迦",
	["Slitherblade Sorceress"] = "滑刃女巫",
	["South of the raceway, the Saltstone Crystalhides (32-33) and Gazers (34-35) roam the far end of the flats."] = "赛道南方，盐石水晶蜥蜴（32-33）和盐石凝视者（34-35）游荡在盐碱地的远端。",
	["South to {area:609}. {quest:1365} (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health.\nCareful: Kolkar Battle Lords call nearby allies within 30 yd once they fall to 20% health."] = "向南到{area:609}。{quest:1365}（35）带着一两名科卡尔队长（32-33）在东侧帐篷间游荡。先清理周围，再以满血状态单独引他。\n小心：科卡尔队长生命值降至20%时，会呼叫30码内的盟友。",
	["South-west back to the raceway."] = "向西南返回赛道。",
	["South-west down the road to the post."] = "沿路向西南下行，返回岗哨。",
	["Sparkleshell Snappers"] = "盐壳钳嘴龟",
	["Swim out to {area:2406} off the far northern tip and use the {item:15766} on the {object:177673}: {npc:12369} (38) rises; kill him for the {quest:6027}. He is well above you: rest to full first. {object:177786} stands on the shore beside the statue: open it with both keys."] = "从最北端游到{area:2406}，对{object:177673}使用{item:15766}：{npc:12369}（38）会现身，击杀他取得{quest:6027}。他等级比你高不少，先休息至满状态。{object:177786}就在雕像旁的岸边，用两把钥匙打开它。",
	["Take the lift down and follow the canyon east. {npc:4483} camps on the north-western edge of the salt flats."] = "乘升降梯下去，沿峡谷向东。{npc:4483}的营地在盐碱地的西北边缘。",
	["The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of {area:2405}; {npc:12369} guards the {quest:6027} at the far northern tip."] = "滑刃纳迦占据着{area:2405}北边的海岸。{npc:12369}在最北端守护着{quest:6027}。",
	["The goblins and gnomes of the {area:2240} are neutral and give quests to both factions."] = "{area:2240}的地精和侏儒是中立的，双方阵营都能接他们的任务。",
	["The southern flats"] = "南部盐碱地",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower outside {zone:1454}'s main gate. {npc:5639} waits in the Drag; {npc:5640} stands in the {object:172961} on the west side of the city."] = "飞艇降落在{zone:1454}正门外的塔楼。{npc:5639}在暗巷区等候；{npc:5640}站在城市西侧的{object:172961}里。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower outside {zone:1454}'s main gate. {npc:5639} walks the Drag: if he isn't at the arrow, look along its streets to the south-west. {npc:5640} stands in the {object:172961} on the west side of the city."] = "飞艇停靠在{zone:1454}正门外的高塔。{npc:5639}在暗巷区四处走动：如果他不在箭头处，就沿暗巷区西南方向的街道找找。{npc:5640}位于城西的{object:172961}。",
	["The {quest:6027}"] = "{quest:6027}",
	["Train while you are in the city."] = "趁在城里学习技能。",
	["Underwater"] = "在水下",
	["Use {npc:11596}'s {item:13892} on an Aged, Dying or {npc:4702} in the graveyard and walk the tamed kodo back to {npc:11596}. At his camp, talk to the kodo: that counts it and lets you tame the next. Five kodos, one at a time."] = "在墓地对老迈的科多兽、濒死的科多兽或{npc:4702}使用{npc:11596}的{item:13892}，把驯服的科多兽带回{npc:11596}身边。到营地后与科多兽对话，才会计入进度并让你驯服下一只。共需五只，每次带一只。",
	["West back to {area:484}. {npc:10537} stands in the middle of the post, on the way to the flight master."] = "向西返回{area:484}。{npc:10537}站在岗哨中央，去飞行管理员的路上会经过。",
	["West of them the silithid swarm the dig site. Searchers and Hive Drones walk among the mounds; the Invaders (34-35) stay inside the hive cave. The first silithid you kill drops a {item:5877}: open it.\nCareful: Hive Drones call for help when they fall to 20% health."] = "它们西边的挖掘场里遍布异种虫。异种搜寻者和异种筑巢蝎在土丘间游荡；异种侵略者（34-35）待在虫巢洞穴里。击杀的第一只异种虫会掉落{item:5877}，打开它。\n小心：异种筑巢蝎生命值降至20%时会呼救。",
	["West to Shadowprey: your hearthstone is bound there."] = "向西前往葬影村：你的炉石已绑定在那里。",
	["West to the shore. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach: each clam you open on the sea floor, and some crawlers, give a {item:15874}. Open each one in your bags for its meat.\nThe Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers on the same beach carry {item:15878}, about one in seven."] = "向西前往海岸。巨型软壳蚌分布在浅水中，狂怒的暗礁蟹在沙滩上行走：在海底打开的每个蚌，以及部分暗礁蟹，都会给你一个{item:15874}。在背包里逐个打开，取出蚌肉。\n同一片沙滩上的旱钳蟹和旱钳巨蟹身上带着{item:15878}，大约每七只掉一把。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}",
	["for the second {zone:1443} visit, in forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh"] = "留到第二次前往{zone:1443}时完成，见forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh",
	["for {npc:5641} in {zone:1443}, later in this guide"] = "交给{zone:1443}的{npc:5641}，本指南稍后会去",
	["grind on {npc:4143}"] = "刷{npc:4143}升级",
	["grind on {npc:4697}"] = "刷{npc:4697}升级",
	["on an Aged, Dying or {npc:4702} in the graveyard; don't kill it"] = "对墓地里的年老的、垂死的或{npc:4702}使用；别把它杀了",
	["the tamed kodo, at {npc:11596}'s camp: talk to it, five times"] = "被驯服的科多兽，在{npc:11596}的营地：和它对话，五次",
	["{area:392} flight master"] = "{area:392}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:439}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:439}：沿途击杀这些目标",
	["{area:484} flight master"] = "{area:484}的飞行管理员",
	["{item:14523}, on the {object:176581}"] = "{item:14523}，对着{object:176581}使用",
	["{item:15766}, on the {object:177673}"] = "{item:15766}，对{object:177673}使用",
	["{item:15874}: open it in your bags"] = "{item:15874}：在背包里打开",
	["{item:15878}, from the Drysnap crabs"] = "{item:15878}，击杀干钳蟹获取",
	["{item:15881}, from the Slitherblade naga"] = "{item:15881}，击杀滑刃纳迦获取",
	["{npc:10537}: for {npc:11259} in {zone:1443}, next"] = "{npc:10537}：交给{zone:1443}的{npc:11259}，接下来会去",
	["{npc:11259}, up on the rise"] = "{npc:11259}，在高地上",
	["{npc:11624}'s Portals of the Legion and {zone:1443}'s other 38-40 quests wait for the second visit, at 38: the next guides fly to {zone:1454} and take the zeppelin to {zone:1434}."] = "{npc:11624}的燃烧军团的传送门，以及{zone:1443}其他38-40级任务，留到38级第二次来时再做。接下来的指南会先飞往{zone:1454}，再乘飞艇前往{zone:1434}。",
	["{npc:11863} waits in the ruined tower of {area:2405}, inland to the east."] = "{npc:11863}在内陆东边{area:2405}的废塔里等候。",
	["{npc:11877}: for {quest:5762} in Stranglethorn, next guide"] = "{npc:11877}：交给荆棘谷的{quest:5762}，下篇指南会去",
	["{npc:268705}, on the path just north of the village"] = "{npc:268705}，在村子北边不远的小路上",
	["{npc:268705}: the Hatefury satyrs of {area:603}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:268705}：目标是{area:603}的怨怒萨特，本指南稍后会去",
	["{npc:3412}'s workshop is in the {object:172958}. {quest:2841} is {area:133}'s last boss: great XP if you run it with a group. Run it whenever your group is ready; hand it in on a later {zone:1454} stop."] = "{npc:3412}的工坊位于{object:172958}。{quest:2841}的目标是{area:133}的最终首领，组队完成可获得大量经验。队伍准备好后随时可去，之后途经{zone:1454}时再交任务。",
	["{npc:4452}'s crate for {quest:5762} in Stranglethorn, later on the route"] = "{npc:4452}的箱子，留给荆棘谷的{quest:5762}，后续路线会去",
	["{npc:4452}: his parts order goes to {quest:1111} in {area:392}, later on the route"] = "{npc:4452}：他的零件订单要送给{area:392}的{quest:1111}，在后面的路线上",
	["{npc:4454}: his letter goes to Martek in the {zone:1418}, at 39"] = "{npc:4454}：他的信要交给{zone:1418}的流放者马特克，39级时会去",
	["{npc:4630}: for Gazlowe in {area:392}, later on the route"] = "{npc:4630}：交给{area:392}的加兹鲁维，后续路线会去",
	["{npc:4671}, on the way south"] = "{npc:4671}，向南途中击杀",
	["{npc:5395} stands in the post, {npc:11259} up on its rise; {npc:5641} and {npc:4498} wait on the rise west of it, above the {area:596}."] = "{npc:5395}站在岗哨里，{npc:11259}在岗哨的高地上；{npc:5641}和{npc:4498}在其西边、{area:596}上方的高地等候。",
	["{npc:5639}: offered from level 30"] = "{npc:5639}：30级起可接",
	["{npc:5641}'s next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it."] = "{npc:5641}的下一个差事要你去对付一个带着精英护卫的恶魔领主：跳过它。",
	["{npc:5641}: for {npc:5640} in {zone:1454}, next guide"] = "{npc:5641}：交给{zone:1454}的{npc:5640}，下篇指南会去",
	["{npc:5892} stands in the {object:172957}."] = "{npc:5892}站在{object:172957}。",
	["{npc:5892}: for {npc:5905} by {area:484}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:5892}：交给{area:484}附近的{npc:5905}，本指南稍后会去",
	["{npc:5901}: {npc:3527} and your {item:5177}"] = "{npc:5901}：{npc:3527}和你的{item:5177}",
	["{npc:5905} also starts Elemental Aid ({area:1717}), the 33-40 chain to The Tempest's Weapons: forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde."] = "{npc:5905}还会开始元素援助（{area:1717}），这是通往风暴武器的33-40级任务线：见萨满祭司职业指南“空气的召唤和风暴武器（部落）”。",
	["{npc:5905} hides in a small cave in the canyon wall north-east of the post, on the way east."] = "{npc:5905}藏在岗哨东北方向峡谷岩壁上的小洞穴里，向东走时会经过。",
	["{npc:5905}: your {item:5178}"] = "{npc:5905}：你的{item:5178}",
	["{npc:6726}, at the village's south-west end"] = "{npc:6726}，在村子西南端",
	["{object:177787} lies on the ground just south-west of {npc:11863}'s tower, on the way down to the shore: read it. Its two keys drop only while you have the quest."] = "{object:177787}就在{npc:11863}所在高塔西南方不远的地上，在下行前往海岸的路上：阅读它。它所需的两把钥匙只有在接了任务后才会掉落。",
	["{object:19868}, all over the northern flats"] = "{object:19868}，遍布北部盐碱地",
	["{quest:1104}, from the Scorpid Reavers of the north half"] = "{quest:1104}，击杀北半部的恐蝎劫掠者获取",
	["{zone:1443}'s quests are 33-38. Below 32.5? Keep killing the Sparkleshell Snappers near the silithid dig and the Saltstone Gazers south of it until level 32.5. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Graveyard or Library) instead."] = "{zone:1443}的任务是33-38级。没到32.5级？继续击杀异种虫挖掘场附近的闪光壳咬龟和它南边的凝视者，直到32.5级。或者组队刷{area:796}地下城（墓地或图书馆）代替。",
	["{zone:1443}'s quests are 33-38. Still below 32.5 after the raceway's hand-ins? Keep killing the Sparkleshell Snappers on the flats just north of the raceway until level 32.5. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Graveyard or Library) instead."] = "{zone:1443}的任务是33-38级。赛道交完任务还不到32.5级？就在赛道正北的平地上继续打亮壳钳龟，直到32.5级。或者组队去刷{area:796}副本（墓地或图书馆）。",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1454} trainers"] = "{zone:1454}的训练师",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["Back north to the camp."] = "向北回到营地。",
	["Back to {area:1637}"] = "返回{area:1637}",
	["Back to {object:3202}."] = "返回{object:3202}。",
	["Boat to {area:35}"] = "乘船前往{area:35}",
	["Dizzywig's parts go back to Kravel in the {area:439}, off the route: leave them."] = "迪兹维格的零件要送回{area:439}的克拉维尔，不在路线上：别接。",
	["Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Below 36? Keep killing the Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors here until level 36; pull one at a time. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Armory) or the {area:1316} dungeon instead."] = "尘泥沼泽的任务是35-38级。没到36级？继续在这里击杀莫什奥格蛮兵和莫什奥格巫医，直到36级；一次拉一只。或者组队刷{area:796}地下城（武器库）或{area:1316}地下城代替。",
	["Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Still below 36 after {object:3202}'s hand-ins? The Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors camp in the hills just east of the camp: kill them until level 36, pulling one at a time, then walk back to the zeppelin tower. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Armory) or the {area:1316} dungeon instead."] = "尘泥沼泽的任务是35-38级。交完{object:3202}的任务还不到36级？莫什奥格蛮兵和巫医就在营地正东的丘陵扎营：杀到36级，一次拉一个，然后走回飞艇塔。或者组队去刷{area:796}副本（军械库）或{area:1316}副本。",
	["East of the Mosh'Ogg hills, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle towards the lake; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for {npc:2495}. Careful: Shadowmaw Panthers (level 37-38) and Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (level 42-43) use Sneak while out of combat, so they remain hidden until you get near them."] = "在莫什奥格丘陵以东，暗鬃黑豹（37-38级）在通往湖边的丛林里潜行；荆棘谷母虎也在同一片活动，偶尔掉一颗完好的牙。硬颚鳄鱼在丛林正西的河边；把它们的皮留着给{npc:2495}。注意：暗鬃黑豹（37-38级）和老暗鬃黑豹（42-43级）脱离战斗时会用潜行，所以在靠近之前一直隐藏着。",
	["East of the ogres, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk unseen until they strike; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for {npc:2495}.\nCareful: Shadowmaw Panthers (level 37-38) and Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (level 42-43) use Sneak while out of combat, so they remain hidden until you get near them."] = "食人魔以东，影颚黑豹（37-38级）潜行跟踪直到出手；荆棘谷母虎在同一片地方游荡，偶尔掉落一枚完好的獠牙。断颚鳄鱼排列在丛林正西的河边；把它们的皮留给{npc:2495}。\n注意：影颚黑豹（37-38级）和老年影颚黑豹（42-43级）在脱战时使用潜行，所以直到你靠近才会现身。",
	["Elder Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "老年荆棘谷虎",
	["Elder Stranglethorn Tigers"] = "老年荆棘谷猛虎",
	["Elder tigers and Lashtail raptors"] = "老年猛虎和鞭尾迅猛龙",
	["Fly from {area:2408} to {area:1638} and train with {npc:3033} on {area:1639}; fly on to {zone:1454} from there."] = "从{area:2408}飞往{area:1638}，到{area:1639}找{npc:3033}训练；再从那里飞往{zone:1454}。",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:35}"] = "飞往{area:35}",
	["Fly to {area:392}"] = "飞往{area:392}",
	["Fly to {object:3202}"] = "飞往{object:3202}",
	["Follow the road north out of {object:3202}; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. From here on, keep every page of {quest:338} you loot: {npc:716} asks for them later."] = "沿道路向北离开{object:3202}；奈辛瓦里的狩猎营地在河东北边的山上。从现在起，留着拾取到的每一页{quest:338}：{npc:716}之后会要。",
	["Follow the road north out of {object:3202}; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. {npc:773} wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of {quest:338} you loot: {npc:716} takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit."] = "沿道路向北离开{object:3202}；奈辛瓦里的狩猎营地在河东北边的山上。{npc:773}要你调查那里：在帐篷间走一圈。从现在起，留着拾取到的每一页{quest:338}：下次来荆棘谷时{npc:716}会收取。",
	["Follow the road south to {area:35} at the southern tip of the vale and enter through the tunnel in the cliffs. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is well above your level. {npc:2858}, the Horde flight master, waits on the upper deck."] = "沿道路向南前往山谷南端的{area:35}，从悬崖上的隧道进入。别离开道路：路旁丛林里的怪物比你高得多。部落飞行管理员{npc:2858}在上层甲板等候。",
	["Green Hills pages"] = "荆棘谷的青山书页",
	["Head north to {area:37}, south-east of Nesingwary's camp: the Venture Co. Geologists (34-36) work the camps by the lake and carry the Tumbled Crystals."] = "向北前往{area:37}，它在奈辛瓦里营地东南：风险投资公司地质学家（34-36级）在湖边的营地干活，携带滚落的水晶。",
	["Head south down the coast to {object:3202} and fly to {area:35}."] = "沿海南下到{object:3202}，然后飞往{area:35}。",
	["Lashtail Raptor"] = "鞭尾迅猛龙",
	["Lashtail Raptors"] = "鞭尾迅猛龙",
	["Leave {area:35} through the tunnel and follow the road north to {object:3202}, the orc camp on the west side of the vale. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is above your level."] = "穿过隧道离开{area:35}，沿道路向北前往荆棘谷西侧的兽人营地{object:3202}。别离开道路：路旁丛林里的怪物比你等级高。",
	["Level 35"] = "等级35",
	["Level 36"] = "等级 36",
	["Mosh'Ogg Brute"] = "莫什奥格蛮兵",
	["Mosh'Ogg Witch Doctor"] = "莫什奥格巫医",
	["Mosh'Ogg camp"] = "莫什奥格营地",
	["Nesingwary's camp"] = "奈辛瓦里的营地",
	["North-west of Grom'gol the {area:104} lies under the water off the coast. The {item:4094} rests on the sea floor by the sunken ruins; watch your breath and the murlocs."] = "{area:104}位于格罗姆高营地西北的近海水下。{item:4094}躺在沉没废墟旁的海底；注意呼吸和鱼人。",
	["On your way back south to {object:3202}, the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle between the camp and {object:3202}: they count for Hemet and for {npc:2464}."] = "在你向南回{object:3202}的路上，鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36级）在营地和{object:3202}之间的丛林里捕猎：它们算赫米特和{npc:2464}的进度。",
	["Pages of The {item:2755} drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; keep every page you loot and look on the auction house for the rest. {npc:716} takes the chapters later in this guide."] = "{item:2755}的每一页从血顶巨魔和劈颅巨魔身上的掉率约为1%；留着拾取到的每一页，其余的去拍卖行找。{npc:716}会在本指南稍后收取各章节。",
	["Pages of The {item:2755} drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; keep every page you loot and look on the auction house for the rest. {npc:716} takes the chapters on your next Stranglethorn visit, at about 40."] = "{item:2755}的书页从血顶和碎颅巨魔身上各掉约1%；捡到的每一页都留着，其余的到拍卖行找。{npc:716}收章节，下次来荆棘谷时（大约40级）。",
	["Panther"] = "豹",
	["River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp. Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers east of it. Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A {item:4614} is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it. Careful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight."] = "淡水鳄趴在营地下方的河边。荆棘谷猛虎幼崽在营地西侧徘徊，猎豹幼崽则在营地东侧。向西经过营地。荆棘谷迅猛龙（33-34级）在空地上狩猎，血顶巨魔占据着海岸废墟：任何血顶巨魔都可能掉落獠牙。它们有极低概率掉落{item:4614}：掉落后记得阅读。小心：巨魔营地有很多巡逻怪，因此其他巨魔经常会加入战斗。",
	["Shadowmaw Panther"] = "暗齿豹",
	["Shadowmaw panthers"] = "深喉猎豹",
	["Stranglethorn Raptor"] = "荆棘谷迅猛龙",
	["Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "荆棘谷虎",
	["Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills around the camp and south of it, Panthers (32) the clearings west and south-west of it. The Venture Co. Geologists, who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by {area:37}, south-east of the camp."] = "荆棘谷猛虎（32级）在营地周围及南边的山丘上游荡，黑豹（32级）在营地西边和西南边的空地上游荡。营地东南方、{area:37}旁的营地中，风险投资公司地质学家带着打磨过的水晶工作。",
	["The Bloodscalp Headhunters (36-37) in the village on the coast carry the shrunken heads.\nThe Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins up the coast north of the reef and the village beyond; every one can drop a {item:3915}. Keep looting pages of {quest:338}."] = "海边村庄中的血顶猎头者（36—37级）带着皱缩的头颅。\n血顶巨魔占据着礁石北面沿海的废墟及更远处的村庄；每一只都有可能掉落 {item:3915}。继续拾取 {quest:338} 的书页。",
	["The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp. Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly."] = "老年荆棘谷猛虎（34-35级）在营地西南的丘陵游荡。注意：巨魔营地离老虎的地盘很近，拉怪不小心就会有巨魔加入战斗。",
	["The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp; the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt further south, towards {object:3202}.\nCareful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly."] = "老年荆棘谷虎（34-35级）在营地西南的丘陵游荡；鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36级）在更南边、朝{object:3202}方向狩猎。\n注意：巨魔营地离虎区很近，鲁莽拉怪会让巨魔加入战斗。",
	["The Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle just north-east of {object:3202}."] = "鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36级）在{object:3202}东北不远的丛林里捕猎。",
	["The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of {object:3202}, on your way back. Kill 10 Brutes and 5 Witch Doctors (36-37); pull them one at a time."] = "莫什奥格食人魔在{object:3202}正东的丘陵扎营，就在你回程路上。杀10个蛮兵和5个巫医（36-37级）；一次拉一个。",
	["The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of {object:3202}. Kill one Brute and one Witch Doctor (36-37); pull them one at a time."] = "莫什奥格食人魔在{object:3202}正东的山丘上扎营。杀死一个莫什奥格蛮兵和一个莫什奥格巫医（36-37级）；一次引一个。",
	["The Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle east of the Mosh'Ogg hills and north-east towards the lake; they strike from stealth. Loot every Green Hills page you find on the way."] = "深喉猎豹（37-38级）在莫什奥格山丘东边和东北方通往湖泊的丛林里潜行；它们会从潜行中发动攻击。沿途拾取你找到的每一页荆棘谷的青山。",
	["The Shadowmaw Panthers come much later, by {object:3202}"] = "深喉猎豹要很久以后才会遇到，在{object:3202}附近",
	["The camp by the river"] = "河边的营地",
	["The next guide takes the zeppelin to {zone:1454} from the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "下一份指南会从营地西侧的塔楼乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "飞艇降落在营地西侧的塔上。",
	["Train while you are in the city."] = "趁在城里先训练。",
	["Underwater"] = "在水下",
	["Upstairs"] = "楼上",
	["Venture Co. camp"] = "风险投资公司营地",
	["West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.\n{npc:729}, a level 37 tiger, prowls the hilltop south-west of the camp.\nCareful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults."] = "向西经过营地，晶背蜥蜴（34-35 级）就在岩石上；再往前村子里的每只血顶巨魔都可能掉落耳朵。\n{npc:729} 是一只 37 级老虎，在营地西南的山顶游荡。\n小心：迅猛龙巢里有幼龙，攻击成年迅猛龙时，它们也会加入战斗。",
	["Young Panther"] = "幼豹",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "幼年荆棘谷虎",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers south and east of it.\nHead west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A {item:4614} is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it.\nCareful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight."] = "幼年荆棘谷虎在营地以西游荡，幼年黑豹在营地以南和以东。\n向西经过营地。荆棘谷迅猛龙（33-34级）在林间空地狩猎，血顶巨魔占据海岸的废墟：每个血顶巨魔都可能掉落獠牙。{item:4614}是它们身上极稀有的掉落：掉出来就读一读。\n注意：巨魔营地有很多巡逻怪，所以常有其他巨魔加入战斗。",
	["Zeppelin to {object:3202}"] = "乘飞艇前往{object:3202}",
	["from {npc:4723}"] = "从{npc:4723}身上获取",
	["grind on {npc:1142}"] = "击杀{npc:1142}刷经验",
	["grind on {npc:686}"] = "刷{npc:686}升级",
	["{area:100}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:100}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:102}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:102}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:2408} flight master"] = "{area:2408}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:301}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:301}：沿途击杀以下目标",
	["{area:35} first: the goblins' boat sails there from {area:392}, and every {area:35} quest is for the north of the vale, which you then walk up into."] = "先去{area:35}：地精的船从{area:392}开往那里，而且{area:35}的任务全都在荆棘谷北部，之后你会一路向北走过去。",
	["{area:35} flight master"] = "{area:35}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:35}'s and {object:3202}'s next quests are 35-38. Below 35? The Lashtail Raptors (35) hunt the slopes south of the camp, on your way back to {object:3202}: kill them until level 35. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Library or Armory) instead."] = "{area:35}和{object:3202}接下来的任务是35-38级。没到35级？鞭尾迅猛龙（35级）在营地以南的斜坡上捕猎，就在返回{object:3202}的路上：一直杀到35级。或者组队刷{area:796}地下城（图书馆或武器库）代替。",
	["{area:35}'s and {object:3202}'s next quests are 35-38. Still below 35 after Aggro'gosh's hand-in? The Lashtail Raptors (35) hunt the jungle just north of {object:3202}: kill them until level 35. Or, with a group, run the {area:796} dungeon (Library or Armory) instead."] = "{area:35}和{object:3202}接下来的任务是35-38级。交完阿格罗戈什的任务还不到35级？鞭尾迅猛龙（35级）在{object:3202}正北的丛林里捕猎：杀到35级。或者组队去刷{area:796}副本（图书馆或军械库）。",
	["{item:5852}, in {object:20691}"] = "{item:5852}：在{object:20691}里",
	["{npc:2464} stands in the middle of {object:3202}, {npc:2497} near the zeppelin tower, {npc:2465} beside the flight master."] = "{npc:2464}站在{object:3202}中央，{npc:2497}在飞艇塔附近，{npc:2465}在飞行管理员旁边。",
	["{npc:2465}, beside the flight master: the Shadowmaw and tigress parts come after the trolls"] = "{npc:2465}，在飞行管理员旁边：深喉猎豹和母虎的环节排在巨魔之后",
	["{npc:2465}: for forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = "{npc:2465}：留到forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale指南再做",
	["{npc:2465}: the Shadowmaw claws and the tigress fang come at the end of this guide"] = "{npc:2465}：暗鬃爪和母虎的牙在本指南结尾拿",
	["{npc:2495}'s shop is in the building east of the inn; {npc:2498} is on the inn's bottom floor, {npc:2496}, {npc:737} and {npc:773} upstairs beside the flight master."] = "{npc:2495}的商店在旅店东边的建筑里；{npc:2498}在旅店底层，{npc:2496}、{npc:737}和{npc:773}在楼上飞行管理员旁边。",
	["{npc:2495}, inside"] = "{npc:2495}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2496}, upstairs"] = "{npc:2496}：在楼上",
	["{npc:2496}: Cozzle's footlocker is at {area:37}, later in this guide"] = "{npc:2496}：考兹尔的提箱在{area:37}，本指南稍后会去",
	["{npc:2496}: for Pozzik at the {area:2240}, on the way to {zone:1446} around level 43"] = "{npc:2496}：交给{area:2240}的波兹克，大约43级前往{zone:1446}时顺路",
	["{npc:2497} waits in {object:3202}, near the zeppelin tower."] = "{npc:2497}在{object:3202}里等候，就在飞艇塔附近。",
	["{npc:2497}: for Arathi, later on the route"] = "{npc:2497}：交给阿拉希高地，路线后面会去",
	["{npc:2497}: for forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = "{npc:2497}：留到forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale指南再做",
	["{npc:2498}, inside"] = "{npc:2498}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2498}, inside, on the bottom floor"] = "{npc:2498}，在里面最底层",
	["{npc:3391} waits upstairs in the house by the flight master; {quest:1111} stands on the docks, beside the boat."] = "{npc:3391}在飞行管理员旁边那栋房子的楼上；{quest:1111}站在码头上，船的旁边。",
	["{npc:3391}, upstairs"] = "{npc:3391}：在楼上",
	["{npc:3391}: for {npc:4631} in {area:35}, where the boat goes"] = "{npc:3391}：交给{area:35}的{npc:4631}，船就开往那里",
	["{npc:4631} stands on the pier where the boat docks. {npc:2495}'s shop is in the building east of the inn; {npc:2498} is on the inn's bottom floor, {npc:2496}, {npc:737} and {npc:773} upstairs, {npc:2858} the flight master on the upper deck."] = "{npc:4631}站在船靠岸的码头上。{npc:2495}的商店在旅店东边的建筑里；{npc:2498}在旅店底层，{npc:2496}、{npc:737}和{npc:773}在楼上，飞行管理员{npc:2858}在上层甲板。",
	["{npc:4631}, on the pier"] = "{npc:4631}：在码头上",
	["{npc:4723} (38) is inside the Venture Co. house on {area:37}'s west shore, among the geologists: his key opens {object:20691} in the same house, which holds the blueprints for {npc:2496}."] = "{npc:4723}（38级）在{area:37}西岸的风险投资公司房屋里，周围都是地质学家：他的钥匙能打开同一栋房屋里的{object:20691}，里面装着给{npc:2496}的蓝图。",
	["{npc:5640} stands in the {object:172961} on the west side of the city."] = "{npc:5640}站在城市西侧的{object:172961}。",
	["{npc:737}, upstairs"] = "{npc:737}：在楼上",
	["{npc:773}'s missing hunters' camp is Nesingwary's: walk among its tents and the investigation completes. River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp."] = "{npc:773}失踪猎人的营地就是奈辛瓦里的营地：在帐篷间走一圈，调查就会完成。淡水鳄趴在营地下方的河边。",
	["{npc:773}, upstairs"] = "{npc:773}：在楼上",
	["{object:3202} flight master"] = "{object:3202} 的飞行管理员。",
	["{quest:1111}, on the docks"] = "{quest:1111}：在码头上",
	["{zone:1434}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1434}：沿途击杀以下目标",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}的飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1454} trainers"] = "{zone:1454}训练师",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh"] = {
	["Back to {area:1637}"] = "返回{area:1637}",
	["Back to {area:496}"] = "回到{area:496}",
	["Crossroads flight master"] = "十字路口飞行管理员",
	["Darkmist cavern"] = "暗雾洞穴",
	["Fly from {area:2408} to {area:1638} and train with {npc:3033} on {area:1639}; fly on to {zone:1454} from there."] = "从{area:2408}飞往{area:1638}，到{area:1639}找{npc:3033}训练；再从那里飞往{zone:1454}。",
	["Fly to the Crossroads"] = "飞往十字路口",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:2408}"] = "飞往{area:2408}",
	["Fly to {area:378}"] = "飞往{area:378}",
	["Fly to {area:392}"] = "飞往{area:392}",
	["For {npc:2519} at {object:3202}, in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = "交给{object:3202}的{npc:2519}，在forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale指南中处理",
	["For {npc:2519} at {object:3202}, in the next guide"] = "交给{object:3202}的{npc:2519}，在下一个指南中",
	["Head back west to Brackenwall with the head."] = "带着头颅往西回到蕨墙村。",
	["Head back west to Brackenwall with the head: {npc:4503} stands at the south edge of the village where the road comes in, {npc:4791} in the village."] = "带着头颅向西返回蕨墙村：{npc:4503}站在道路进入村庄处的南缘，{npc:4791}在村子里。",
	["Head east back to the {area:497}."] = "向东返回 {area:497}。",
	["Head east from {area:378} along the road into the marsh. The burned-out {area:403} stands beside it just past the border; the shield, the badge and the hoofprints are in and beside the ruin."] = "从 {area:378} 沿道路向东进入沼泽。越过地区边界后不远，道路旁便是被烧毁的 {area:403}；盾牌、徽章和蹄印就在废墟里及附近。",
	["Head east to {area:602}. Use the Rod of Banishing by each demon portal to close six of them.\nCareful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake."] = "往东到{area:602}。在每个恶魔传送门旁使用放逐之杖，关闭其中六个。\n小心：地狱火、末日守卫和燃刃召唤者会在许多传送门附近走动，可能加入战斗；先清掉附近的怪物，或者把守卫引开，比如引向集会所中央的湖。",
	["Head east to {area:602}. With the {quest:5381} from {npc:11624} in your bags, open a demon portal's ring: a {npc:11937} (38-39) comes out; kill it to close that portal. Six portals. Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake."] = "向东到{area:602}。包里带着{npc:11624}给的{quest:5381}时，打开恶魔传送门的法阵：会出来一个{npc:11937}（38-39级）；杀掉它就能关上那个传送门。一共六个门。注意：地狱火、末日守卫和燃烧之刃召唤者常在多个门附近走动，可能加入战斗；先清掉附近的怪，或者把守卫往别处拉，比如拉向集会的中央湖。",
	["Head north to {area:502}. Stinky stands at the foot of the hill; escort him while he gathers Bogbean Leaves just south of it."] = "向北前往{area:502}。伊格纳兹站在山脚下；护送他去南面不远处采集他要的植物叶片。",
	["Head north to {npc:5412} at {area:597}."] = "往北到{area:597}的{npc:5412}处。",
	["Head north up the road to the hut by the road north of the graveyard."] = "沿路向北，到墓地以北路边的小屋。",
	["Head north-east to the {area:607}. {npc:12277} is held in the Maraudine centaur camp; free her and escort her out east of the valley.\nCareful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help."] = "往东北到{area:607}。{npc:12277}被关在玛拉多半人马营地；救出她并护送她到山谷以东。\n小心：脚本刷出的队伍是仇恨联动的，而且只在护送期间出现，所以无法事先清掉，也不能一只只拉。出发前把路上的普通半人马清掉确实有帮助。",
	["Head on south-west to Shadowprey."] = "继续向西南到暗影村。",
	["Head south along the coast from {area:392} to {area:720}. {npc:6236} stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then {npc:6238} (33)."] = "从{area:392}沿海岸向南前往{area:720}。{npc:6236}站在竞技场旁：踩上格栅开始战斗；挑战者会逐个上场，最后是{npc:6238}（33级）。",
	["Head south from {area:2405} into the {area:607}. The Maraudine Scouts, Wranglers, Maulers, Windchasers and Marauders (36-39) drop the {quest:93225}."] = "从{area:2405}向南进入{area:607}。玛拉多斥候、牧者、殴打者、追风者和掠夺者（36-39级）会掉落{quest:93225}。",
	["Head south-east from the coven to the bone fields of the {area:2657}, where Undead Ravagers roam. At the far south-east, use the {item:15848} to draw the Magrami Spectres: they drop the ghost-o-plasm."] = "从集会所往东南到{area:2657}的骸骨旷野，那里有亡灵劫掠者游荡。在最东南角使用{item:15848}引出玛格拉姆幽灵：它们掉落幽灵原生质。",
	["Head south-east to the bone fields of the {area:2657}, where Undead Ravagers roam. At the far south-east, use the {item:15848} to draw the Magrami Spectres: they drop the ghost-o-plasm."] = "向东南前往{area:2657}的白骨荒地，那里有亡灵劫掠者游荡。在最东南边使用{item:15848}引来玛格拉姆鬼魂：它们会掉落幽灵电浆。",
	["Head west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.\nThe Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes.\nCareful: Darkfang Lurkers (level 36-37) use Sneak to stealth while out of combat and cast Poison once fighting.\nCareful: Stealthed spiders in the same area will attack you on sight.\nCareful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them."] = "向西返回，穿过沼泽。蕨墙村北面山脊上的暗牙毒蜘蛛会掉落毒囊。塞拉摩间谍（35-36级）潜行穿行于同一片树林中：它们处于潜行状态，要仔细寻找。\n暗雾蜘蛛聚集在蕨墙村西北面的洞口；所有种类都会掉落眼睛。\n小心：暗牙潜伏者（36-37级）会在脱战时使用潜行，战斗时施放毒药。\n小心：同一区域内潜行的蜘蛛看到你就会攻击。\n小心：暗雾潜伏者会潜行移动，进入战斗后使用毒药。蜘蛛站得很密，经常会引到额外怪物；从外围逐个引怪能减少这种情况。",
	["His next errand is not on this route."] = "他的下一个任务不在这条路线上。",
	["Jarl lives in the {area:497} south-east of {area:502}."] = "加尔住在{area:502}东南的{area:497}。",
	["Kodo bones"] = "科多兽骨头",
	["Level 37.5"] = "等级37.5",
	["Maraudine totems"] = "玛洛迪图腾",
	["Mirefin murlocs"] = "黑鳍鱼人",
	["North to the goblin camp on the west side of the {area:596}."] = "向北到{area:596}西侧的地精营地。",
	["North to the post; {npc:5412} stands beside {npc:5395}."] = "向北到哨所；{npc:5412}站在{npc:5395}旁。",
	["On the top floor"] = "在顶层",
	["Pick up the kodo bones scattered across the graveyard."] = "拾取散落在墓地各处的科多兽骨头。",
	["Shadowprey"] = "葬影村",
	["Slitherblade Myrmidon"] = "滑刃侍从",
	["Slitherblade Naga"] = "滑刃纳迦",
	["Slitherblade Sorceress"] = "滑刃女巫",
	["Slitherblade coast"] = "滑刃海岸",
	["South-east from the manor to {area:513}: the {object:20925} lies on the sea floor off the docks on the isle's east side. Swim in and out and keep off the piers and the town: Theramore's guards are level 53-57."] = "从庄园向东南前往{area:513}：{object:20925}在岛东侧码头外的海底。游进游出，远离码头栈桥和城镇：塞拉摩的卫兵是53-57级。",
	["Stinky Ignatz"] = "伊格纳兹",
	["Swamp Eye Jarl"] = "“沼泽之眼”加尔",
	["Take the road north at the fork to the ogre village of Brackenwall."] = "在岔路口沿道路向北，前往食人魔村庄蕨墙村。",
	["The Burning Blade hold the fortress north-west of {area:2407}. Use the {item:14523} on the {npc:11876} in the fortress to get the {item:13542}."] = "火刃氏族占据着{area:2407}西北的要塞。在要塞里对{npc:11876}使用{item:14523}，获得{item:13542}。",
	["The Mirefin murlocs crowd the coast east and north-east of {area:502}; every kind drops heads."] = "黑鳍鱼人聚集在{area:502}东边和东北边的海岸上；每种都会掉落头。",
	["The Seer stands on the south side of {area:599}, east of {area:2405}. Clear the cultists around it first."] = "先知站在{area:599}南侧、{area:2405}以东。先清掉它周围的信徒。",
	["The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of {area:2405}, up to {area:598}. {npc:12369} guards the {quest:6027} at the far northern tip."] = "滑刃纳迦占据着{area:2405}北边直到{area:598}的海岸。{npc:12369}在最北端守护着{quest:6027}。",
	["The middle of {zone:1454}"] = "{zone:1454}中部",
	["The next guide takes the {zone:1458} zeppelin from the tower outside the main gate."] = "下一份指南会在正门外的飞艇塔乘坐前往{zone:1458}的飞艇。",
	["The next guide takes you back to {zone:1434}."] = "下一个指南会带你回到{zone:1434}。",
	["The {area:2657}"] = "{area:2657}",
	["Theramore Infiltrator"] = "塞拉摩渗透者",
	["Train while you are in the city; everyone else trains in the {zone:1458}, next."] = "趁在城里先训练；其他人接下来去{zone:1458}训练。",
	["Underwater"] = "在水下",
	["West of the post, the Maraudine centaurs hold the {area:607}. Every Maraudine can drop a {item:254432} and an ear for {npc:5395}'s {quest:1366}."] = "哨所西边的{area:607}被玛洛迪半人马占据。所有玛洛迪半人马都可能掉落{item:254432}，以及{npc:5395}的{quest:1366}所需的耳朵。",
	["West to Shadowprey."] = "向西到葬影村。",
	["Your trainer is in {area:1638}: fly there (no flight path there yet? fly to {area:378} and head west through {zone:1412}), then on to {area:496}."] = "你的训练师在{area:1638}：飞过去（如果那里还没有飞行点，就先飞到{area:378}，穿过{zone:1412}往西），然后再去{area:496}。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1454}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1454}",
	["for {npc:4485} in {zone:1454}, at the end of this guide"] = "交给{zone:1454}的{npc:4485}，本指南结尾再做",
	["grind on {npc:4362}"] = "刷{npc:4362}",
	["grind on {npc:4377}"] = "刷{npc:4377}",
	["only if you carry a {item:3853} ({skill:164} or the Auction House)"] = "仅当你带着{item:3853}时（{skill:164}或拍卖行）",
	["{area:2408} flight master"] = "{area:2408}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:380} flight master"] = "{area:380}飞行管理员",
	["{area:392} flight master"] = "{area:392}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:496} flight master"] = "{area:496}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:496}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:496}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{item:3713}, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"] = "{item:3713}，交给“沼泽之眼”加尔",
	["{npc:11624} stands in the village."] = "{npc:11624}站在村里。",
	["{npc:12277} is held in the Maraudine camp at the valley's western end; free her and escort her out east of the valley.\nCareful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help."] = "{npc:12277}被关在山谷最西端的玛洛迪营地；救出她，向东护送她离开山谷。\n小心：脚本刷出的敌群会一起行动，而且仅在护送期间出现，因此无法提前清理，也无法逐个引出。开始前先清理路上的普通半人马仍有帮助。",
	["{npc:3354}, {object:172958}: for {area:720}, later in this guide (offered from level 30)"] = "{object:172958}的{npc:3354}：前往{area:720}的任务，本指南稍后再做（30级可接）",
	["{npc:3391} waits upstairs in the house by the flight master; {npc:3446} stands below it, towards the docks."] = "{npc:3391}在飞行管理员旁那栋房子的楼上等候；{npc:3446}站在楼下，朝码头方向。",
	["{npc:3391}'s next errand takes you to {area:35}, off this part of the route: leave it."] = "{npc:3391}的下一个差事要你去{area:35}，不在这段路线上：别接。",
	["{npc:3412}'s workshop is in the {object:172958} beside {npc:4485}: hand in {quest:2841} if you ran {area:133}."] = "{npc:3412}的工坊在{npc:4485}旁的{object:172958}里：如果你跑过{area:133}，就在这里交{quest:2841}。",
	["{npc:3412}, in the {object:172958} beside {npc:4485}: {quest:2841}, if you ran {area:133}"] = "{npc:3412}，在{object:172958}里{npc:4485}旁边：{quest:2841}，如果你打过{area:133}",
	["{npc:3428} stands beside the Crossroads flight master."] = "{npc:3428}站在十字路口飞行管理员旁。",
	["{npc:3446} stands below Gazlowe's house by the flight master, towards the docks."] = "{npc:3446}站在飞行管理员旁加兹鲁维的房子下方、靠码头的一侧。",
	["{npc:4485} stands in the {object:172958}."] = "{npc:4485}站在{object:172958}。",
	["{npc:4501}, below ground"] = "{npc:4501}，在地下",
	["{npc:4503}, at the south edge of the village where the road comes in"] = "{npc:4503}，在道路进入村庄处的南缘",
	["{npc:4711} walks around {area:598}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:4711}在{area:598}一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:4714} walks around {area:598}: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:4714}在{area:598}一带走动：看地图圆圈内",
	["{npc:4983} waits in the {area:2302} east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out."] = "{npc:4983}在村庄东边的{area:2302}等候。跟着他去找雷瑟，并在随后爆发的战斗中保护他活下来。",
	["{npc:5395} and {npc:5412} stand in the post just west of Smeed's camp."] = "{npc:5395}和{npc:5412}站在斯米德营地西边的哨所里。",
	["{npc:6019} waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the {area:596}."] = "{npc:6019}在{area:596}西侧的地精营地里等候。",
	["{object:20985}, beside the manor"] = "{object:20985}，在庄园旁边",
	["{object:20985}, now that {npc:4791} has read the report"] = "{object:20985}，现在{npc:4791}已经读过报告了",
	["{quest:1218}, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"] = "{quest:1218}，给“沼泽之眼”贾尔",
	["{quest:1218}, if you did not buy them in {zone:1454}"] = "{quest:1218}，如果之前没在{zone:1454}购买",
	["{zone:1443}'s last quests and Alterac are 38-41. Below 37.5? Keep killing the Mirefin murlocs along the north-east coast, past {area:502}, until level 37.5. Or, with a group, run the {area:1316} dungeon or the {area:796} dungeon (Armory) instead."] = "{zone:1443}最后的任务和奥特兰克是38-41级。没到37.5级？沿东北海岸越过{area:502}继续击杀黑鳍鱼人，直到37.5级。或者组队刷{area:1316}地下城或{area:796}地下城（武器库）代替。",
	["{zone:1443}'s last quests and Alterac are 38-41. Still below 37.5 after Brackenwall's hand-ins? The Darkmist spiders and Lurkers (35-38) by the cavern north-west of the village are the closest: kill them until level 37.5. Or, with a group, run the {area:1316} dungeon or the {area:796} dungeon (Armory) instead."] = "{zone:1443}最后几个任务和奥特兰克是38-41级。交完蕨墙村的任务还不到37.5级？村子西北、洞穴旁的暗雾蜘蛛和潜伏者（35-38级）最近：杀到37.5级。或者组队去刷{area:1316}副本或{area:796}副本（军械库）。",
	["{zone:1454} flight master"] = "{zone:1454}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1454} trainers"] = "{zone:1454}训练师",
	["{zone:1456} flight master"] = "{zone:1456}飞行管理员",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands"] = {
	["Back north-east to {area:321}."] = "向东北返回{area:321}。",
	["Back to {area:321}"] = "回到{area:321}",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Boulderfist Brute"] = "石拳蛮兵",
	["Boulderfist Lord"] = "石拳领主",
	["Boulderfist Magus"] = "石拳法师",
	["Boulderfist Shaman"] = "石拳萨满祭司",
	["Boulderfist quests for a group"] = "石拳组队任务",
	["Daggerspine Raider"] = "刺脊袭击者",
	["Daggerspine Sorceress"] = "刺脊女巫",
	["Dalaran Summoner"] = "达拉然召唤师",
	["Each {object:180105} is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of {area:321}.\nCareful: Each center stone is guarded by around three elementals near level 39 that attack together if you click the stone without clearing them: Burning Exiles at West, Thundering Exiles at Outer, Cresting Exiles at East."] = "每个{object:180105}都是一圈竖石；钥匙就在中央的石头上。东部法阵位于{area:321}西北面的山丘上。\n小心：每块中央石头都由约3只接近39级的元素守卫，若不先清怪就点击石头，它们会一起攻击：西部是烈焰流放者，外部是雷霆流放者，东部是水浪流放者。",
	["Elemental Slave"] = "元素奴隶",
	["Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming."] = "护送教授上山，前往海湾上方的洞穴，并在他工作时保护他。两只40级水元素会在那里伏击，而且免疫冰霜。将它们挡在洞口，远离教授：如果在洞内战斗，他就会参战而停止工作，水元素也会不断出现。",
	["Find where {quest:503} is held, on the top floor"] = "到顶层找到关着{quest:503}的地方",
	["Fleshstalker raptors"] = "猎兽龙",
	["Fly to {area:272}"] = "飞往{area:272}",
	["Follow the road east. The violet shards glow just off the road a short way west of {area:321}."] = "沿路向东。在{area:321}以西不远的路旁，能看到发光的紫色碎片。",
	["Go'shek Farm"] = "Go'shek Farm",
	["Head back east to {area:272}."] = "向东返回{area:272}。",
	["Head east out of {area:272} through {area:1057}. The Syndicate hold the walled manor and its farm north of the road; their Highwaymen, Mercenaries and Pathstalkers carry the Bloodstone Amulets.\nCareful: Highwaymen (level 30-31) can be in Sneak, so they may be hidden when you approach."] = "从{area:272}向东穿过{area:1057}。辛迪加占据道路北面的围墙庄园及农场；辛迪加路霸、辛迪加雇佣兵和Pathstalkers携带血石护符。\n小心：辛迪加路霸（30-31级）可能处于Sneak潜行状态，靠近时未必能看到。",
	["Head north past Valik's camp to {area:280}, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). {npc:2431} carries the {item:3704}; {quest:503} sits in a cage in the house on the north side.\nCareful: Stealthed Syndicate spies roam {area:280}, and the buildings hold many Syndicate mobs, mages among them."] = "向北经过Valik的营地，前往被辛迪加占据的村庄{area:280}（35-37级）。{npc:2431}携带{item:3704}；{quest:503}被关在北侧房屋的笼子里。\n小心：潜行的辛迪加密探在{area:280}游荡，房屋里也有许多辛迪加怪物，包括法师。",
	["Head north-west through the mountains to the Perenolde manor on the northern shore of {area:1339}. {quest:507} (41) waits in a room upstairs: he shields himself, puts you to sleep and heals below half health. {npc:2317} stands beside him."] = "向西北穿过群山，前往{area:1339}北岸的匹瑞诺德庄园。{quest:507}（41级）在楼上一个房间里：他会给自己套盾、使你沉睡，并在生命值低于一半时治疗自己。{npc:2317}站在他旁边。",
	["Head south to the goblins' cove on the southern coast. {npc:2766} keeps watch on the cliff above it."] = "向南前往南部海岸的地精海湾。{npc:2766}在海湾上方的悬崖放哨。",
	["Head west; the outer circle stands in the middle of the highlands."] = "向西走；外禁锢法阵位于高地中央。",
	["Highland Fleshstalkers (36-37) hunt the southern highlands, a pack north of {area:316} and another on the plain to its west. Pull them one at a time."] = "高地猎兽龙（36-37级）在南部高地狩猎，一群在{area:316}北边，另一群在其西边的平原上。一次拉一只。",
	["Inside"] = "在里面",
	["Lord Aliden Perenolde"] = "阿利登·佩雷诺德领主",
	["North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael.\nCareful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them."] = "落锤镇东北面的枯须狗头人在峡谷采矿；洞口的狗头人以及深处的掘地工和勘探员都掉落密斯莱尔的碎片。\n小心：所有类型的狗头人都会在低血量时逃跑求援（狗头人为30%，勘探员和掘地工为15%），可能引来更多敌人。",
	["Only if you ran Stromgarde with a group: back to {area:321} for its hand-ins, then on to the {area:880}."] = "仅在组队做过激流堡任务时：返回{area:321}交任务，然后前往{area:880}。",
	["Perenolde manor"] = "匹瑞诺德庄园",
	["South along the lake shore to the ruins around the {area:279} crater. The Dalaran Summoners lead Elemental Slaves; the bracers drop from the slaves."] = "沿湖岸向南，前往{area:279}巨坑周围的废墟。达拉然召唤师带着元素奴仆；护腕由奴仆掉落。",
	["Stromgarde"] = "激流堡",
	["Stromgarde quests for a group"] = "激流堡组队任务",
	["The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall south of {area:321}; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time."] = "石拳蛮兵在{area:321}南边食人魔大厅外扎营；石拳法师站在它们中间。一次拉一个。",
	["The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall, far south-west of {area:321}; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time."] = "石拳蛮兵在食人魔大厅外扎营，在{area:321}西南很远的地方；法师站在他们中间。一次拉一个。",
	["The inner circle lies south of the western circle, east of Stromgarde."] = "内部法阵在西部法阵南边、激流堡东边。",
	["The magus offers a dungeon errand next: leave it."] = "那位魔导师接下来提供的是一个地下城差事：别接。",
	["The next guide crosses the {area:880} into the {zone:1437} and heads for the {zone:1418}."] = "下一个指南会穿过{area:880}进入{zone:1437}，再前往{zone:1418}。",
	["The road east through {area:1057}"] = "向东穿过{area:1057}的道路",
	["The stone's next task needs Fozruk, a level 42 elite who roams west of {area:321}: leave it."] = "石头的下一步任务需要击败Fozruk，一只在{area:321}以西游荡的42级精英：先别做。",
	["The western circle is near {area:1057}, north-west of the outer one."] = "西禁锢法阵在{area:1057}附近，位于外禁锢法阵的西北面。",
	["The {object:138492}"] = "{object:138492}",
	["The {object:1763} poster by the inn"] = "旅店旁的{object:1763}告示",
	["The {object:2690}"] = "{object:2690}",
	["The {object:2691}"] = "{object:2691}",
	["The {object:2701} lie at the far end of the gorge."] = "{object:2701}在峡谷最深处。",
	["The {object:2702}"] = "{object:2702}",
	["Train while you are in the {zone:1458}: the trainers stand in the {object:36070}, the {object:36073} and the {object:36082} (Paladins: {npc:260093})."] = "趁在{zone:1458}时训练：训练师在{object:36070}、{object:36073}和{object:36082}（圣骑士：{npc:260093}）。",
	["Underwater"] = "在水下",
	["West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks."] = "海湾西边，刺脊袭击者和刺脊巫师（38-40级）占据海岸：一次拉一个。两艘沉船在近海浅水中，海图和日志在船里；宝石在沉船周围的海底。",
	["West of the inner circle, Stromgarde's ruins: the Syndicate hold the east half (the Sigil drops from their Conjurors, Prowlers and Magi; {npc:2783} is among them), the Boulderfist the west half by the {area:325} ({npc:2773} waits in one of the roofless houses beside it)."] = "内禁锢法阵西面是激流堡废墟：辛迪加占据东半边（符印由他们的Conjurors、Prowlers和Magi掉落，{npc:2783}也在其中）；石拳食人魔占据{area:325}旁的西半边（{npc:2773}在塔旁一间没有屋顶的房子里）。",
	["Zeppelin to {zone:1458}"] = "乘飞艇前往{zone:1458}",
	["for {npc:2487} in {area:35}, around level 41"] = "交给{area:35}的{npc:2487}，约41级时完成",
	["{area:17707}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:17707}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:328}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:328}：沿途击杀以下目标",
	["{npc:12920}, at the south gate"] = "{npc:12920}，在南门",
	["{npc:2229} waits inside the inn at {area:272}, back south down the road."] = "沿路向南返回{area:272}，{npc:2229}在旅店内。",
	["{npc:2229}, inside"] = "{npc:2229}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2229}, inside the inn"] = "{npc:2229}，在旅店内",
	["{npc:2306} (40) carries the head. He turns up in one spot at a time: the cellar of {area:280}'s inn, or one of the Syndicate tent camps in the uplands north and north-west of the village, which lie on your way to the Perenolde manor. If you already met him while freeing {quest:503}, this step is done."] = "{npc:2306}（40级）带着头。他每次只出现在一个地方：{area:280}旅店的地窖，或者村子以北、西北高地上的辛迪加帐篷营地之一，这些都在你去佩雷诺德庄园的路上。如果你在解救{quest:503}时已经遇到过他，这一步就完成了。",
	["{npc:2410}, inside"] = "{npc:2410}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2437}, inside"] = "{npc:2437}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2703}'s {quest:639} drops from the elite Syndicate (35-38) in Stromgarde's ruins, the west of the highlands. Great XP if you have a group for it: the route passes Stromgarde on its way to the inner circle."] = "{npc:2703}的{quest:639}由高地西部激流堡废墟中的精英辛迪加（35-38级）掉落。有队伍就很值得做，经验丰厚：这条路线前往内禁锢法阵时会经过激流堡。",
	["{npc:2706}'s next {quest:671} is {npc:2783}, a level 40 elite warlock in Stromgarde's Syndicate quarter."] = "{npc:2706}下一步的{quest:671}目标是{npc:2783}，她是激流堡辛迪加区域内的一名40级精英术士。",
	["{npc:2733}'s lab shack stands at Go'shek Farm, north-east of the raptors' plain on the way back to {area:321}; the case of {item:278462} is inside."] = "{npc:2733}的实验室棚屋在戈舍克农场，就在回{area:321}路上迅猛龙平原的东北；装{item:278462}的箱子在里面。",
	["{npc:2733}'s lab shack stands at Go'shek Farm, south-west of the raptors' plain; the case of {item:278462} is inside."] = "{npc:2733}的实验室小屋在迅猛龙平原西南的戈谢克农场；一箱{item:278462}就在里面。",
	["{npc:2771}'s next {quest:678} and {npc:2772}'s {quest:680} are the elite ogres (38-40) in Stromgarde's ogre quarter, on the same group trip as the Sigil."] = "{npc:2771}下一步的{quest:678}和{npc:2772}的{quest:680}，目标都是激流堡食人魔区域内的精英食人魔（38-40级），可与符印任务在同一次组队行程中完成。",
	["{npc:2772}, beside him"] = "{npc:2772}，在他旁边",
	["{npc:2792}, by the gate"] = "{npc:2792}，在大门旁",
	["{quest:503}, on the top floor"] = "{quest:503}，位于顶层",
	["{quest:671} with a group"] = "组队做{quest:671}",
	["{zone:1458} flight master"] = "{zone:1458}飞行管理员",
	["{zone:1458} trainers"] = "{zone:1458}的训练师",
}

G["forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands"] = {
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Every rock elemental in the {zone:1418} drops {npc:6868}'s shards: the Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of {npc:2921}'s camp are the safe ones, about one kill in five. Only the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) in the south-western gulches drop {npc:2921}'s bracers, also about one kill in five: pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way."] = "{zone:1418}的每个岩石元素都掉落{npc:6868}要的碎片：{npc:2921}营地以西平地上的次级岩石元素（37级）最安全，约五杀出一。只有西南部峡谷里的巨型岩石元素（42-44级，远高于你）掉落{npc:2921}要的护腕，同样约五杀出一：一次拉一只，打完休息，或者放弃它们。路上继续击杀还需要的土狼和秃鹫。",
	["Head back south down the road, past the {area:1877}."] = "沿道路向南返回，经过 {area:1877}。",
	["Head for the {object:2673}, the great bridge at Arathi's southern edge, cross it and follow the road south through the {zone:1437} to the {object:1668} tunnel into {zone:1432}. {area:144}, the dwarf town on the road in the middle of {zone:1432}, has guards who attack the Horde: leave the road before it and pass the town on the hills to its west. The road leaves {zone:1432} to the south into the {zone:1418}; follow it to the goblin camp in the {area:1877}."] = "前往{object:2673}，那是阿拉希南缘的大桥，过桥后沿路向南穿过{zone:1437}，进入{object:1668}隧道到{zone:1432}。{area:144}是{zone:1432}中部路边的矮人镇，镇上的卫兵会攻击部落：在到镇子之前离开道路，从它西边的丘陵绕过去。道路从{zone:1432}向南进入{zone:1418}；沿路走到{area:1877}的地精营地。",
	["Head for the {object:2673}, the great bridge at Arathi's southern edge, cross it and go south through the {zone:1437} (keep clear of {area:150}) and east into {zone:1432}; the road leaves {zone:1432} to the south into the {zone:1418}. Follow it south to the goblin camp in the {area:1877}."] = "前往{object:2673}，即阿拉希南缘的大桥，过桥后向南穿过{zone:1437}（避开{area:150}），再向东进入{zone:1432}；道路从{zone:1432}南端通入{zone:1418}。沿路向南到{area:1877}的地精营地。",
	["Head north back to {area:340}. {npc:5394} stands on {area:340}'s upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."] = "向北返回{area:340}。{npc:5394}站在{area:340}上层，远高于飞行管理员：走斜坡上去，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Head west along the road towards {area:340}; {npc:2921}'s camp sits in the {area:1878} halfway there."] = "沿道路向西前往{area:340}；{npc:2921}的营地在半途的{area:1878}。",
	["Head west back to {area:340}. {npc:5394} stands on {area:340}'s upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."] = "向西回到{area:340}。{npc:5394}在{area:340}的上层，就在飞行管理员上方高处：沿坡道上去，箭头分不清层数。",
	["Into the {zone:1418}"] = "进入{zone:1418}",
	["Keep north on the road; the chest lies in the {area:1517} dig site, at the foot of the ruins north-west of the road."] = "继续沿道路向北；箱子在{area:1517}挖掘场，位于道路西北方的废墟脚下。",
	["Lesser Rock Elementals"] = "次级石元素",
	["North-west across the basin to {npc:2921}'s camp. Short of Jarkal's shards? The Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of the camp drop them about one kill in five."] = "穿过盆地向西北到{npc:2921}的营地。贾卡尔的碎片还不够？营地以西平地上的次级岩石元素（37级）大约五个掉一个。",
	["Rock Elementals"] = "{npc:92}",
	["South-east across the basin, the bigger Rock Elementals (39) stand on the slopes west of {area:345}; each one drops a slab. Every rock elemental can drop {npc:6868}'s Rock Elemental Shards."] = "穿过盆地向东南，较大的岩石元素（39级）站在{area:345}以西的山坡上；每个掉一块石板。所有岩石元素都可能掉{npc:6868}要的岩石元素碎片。",
	["Stonevault troggs"] = "石窟穴居人",
	["The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the {area:1878}. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; the Giant Buzzards drop the gizzards."] = "老年峭壁土狼和巨型秃鹫在{area:1878}以南的盆地游荡。土狼既掉颌骨也掉獠牙；巨型秃鹫掉内脏。",
	["The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the {area:1878}. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; the Giant Buzzards drop the gizzards.\nThe bigger Rock Elementals stand on the slopes north-west of the {area:1878}; each one drops a slab. Every rock elemental can drop {npc:6868}'s Rock Elemental Shards."] = "老峭壁土狼和巨型秃鹫在{area:1878}以南的盆地游荡。土狼同时掉落颚骨和尖牙；巨型秃鹫掉落砂囊。\n更大的岩石元素站在{area:1878}西北的斜坡上，每个都掉落一块石板。每个岩石元素都可能掉落{npc:6868}的岩石元素碎片。",
	["The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the {area:1877}, on the way north from {area:345}; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes. The Buzzards for {npc:2817}'s wings circle the hills between the {area:1877} and {area:345}."] = "石窟穴居人在{area:1877}以南的洞口周围挖洞，就在从{area:345}往北的路上；碎骨者和萨满掉薄片。{npc:2817}要的翅膀来自在{area:1877}和{area:345}之间丘陵上空盘旋的秃鹫。",
	["The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the {area:1877}, on the way to {area:345}; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes. The Buzzards for {npc:2817}'s wings circle the hills between the {area:1877} and {area:345}."] = "石窟穴居人在{area:1877}以南、去{area:345}途中的洞口附近挖掘；断骨者和萨满掉落碎片。为{npc:2817}取翅膀的秃鹫在{area:1877}与{area:345}之间的山丘上盘旋。",
	["The next guide flies from {area:340} to {area:35}."] = "下一份攻略从{area:340}飞往{area:35}。",
	["The next guide flies from {area:340} to {object:3202}."] = "下一篇指南从{area:340}飞往{object:3202}。",
	["The road north to {area:1517} runs through the {area:1877}: {npc:2817} and {npc:4618} take the wings and the flakes on the way."] = "向北通往{area:1517}的道路穿过{area:1877}：途中把翅膀和薄片交给{npc:2817}和{npc:4618}。",
	["The small elementals drift across the flats between {area:340} and {npc:2921}'s camp, on the road back east. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop {npc:6868}'s Rock Elemental Shards."] = "小型元素在{area:340}和{npc:2921}营地之间的平地上飘荡，就在向东返回的路上。这个地区的每个石元素都可能掉落{npc:6868}要的石元素的碎片。",
	["Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at {area:345}, just east of the elementals."] = "塞尔杜林坐在{area:345}的矮人废墟里，就在元素以东。",
	["Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at {area:345}, south of the {area:1877}."] = "塞尔杜林坐在{area:1877}南边{area:345}的矮人废墟中。",
	["for Fizzle at the {area:2240}, on the way from {area:484} to {zone:1446} around level 43"] = "给{area:2240}的菲兹尔，43级左右从{area:484}去{zone:1446}的路上",
	["for Helgrum in {area:75}, around level 42"] = "交给{area:75}的赫格拉姆，约42级",
	["{area:1878}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1878}：遇到了就杀",
	["{area:340} is the Horde fortress built into the cliffs at the zone's western edge. {npc:5394} stands on {area:340}'s upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart."] = "{area:340}是建在地区西缘悬崖中的部落要塞。{npc:5394}站在{area:340}的上层，远高于飞行管理员：沿坡道上去，箭头无法区分上下层。",
	["{npc:2920}: only if you carry {item:2868} ({skill:164} or the Auction House)"] = "{npc:2920}：仅当你携带{item:2868}时（{skill:164}或拍卖行）",
	["{npc:2921}'s next study wants bracers from the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) in the south-western gulches, well above you: leave it."] = "{npc:2921}的下一项研究要西南峡谷里巨型岩石元素（42-44级）的护腕，比你高出不少：放着别做。",
	["{npc:6868}, inside"] = "{npc:6868}：在屋内",
	["{quest:1106}: Fizzle's letter from the {area:439}"] = "{quest:1106}：来自{area:439}的菲兹尔的信",
	["{zone:1418}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{zone:1418}：沿途击杀以下目标",
}

G["forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor"] = "“海狼”马克基雷，位于最顶层",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Bloodsail Swashbuckler"] = "血帆剑客",
	["Boat to {area:35}"] = "乘船前往{area:35}",
	["Boat to {area:392}"] = "坐船到{area:392}",
	["Chucky \"Ten Thumbs\""] = "“十指”查基",
	["Draenethyst crystals"] = "德莱尼水晶",
	["Fly to {area:35}"] = "飞往{area:35}",
	["Fly to {area:75}"] = "飞到{area:75}",
	["Fly to {object:3202}"] = "飞往{object:3202}",
	["Follow the coast south. The naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the {object:759} bubbles in the hills just east of them."] = "沿海岸向南。纳迦探险者在岸边涉水而行，携带一捆海蛇草；{object:759}就在他们正东的山丘里冒泡。",
	["Follow the road east from {area:10} through {zone:1430} into the swamp. {npc:1776} waits at the {area:657}, the draenei camp just off the road where it comes in from {zone:1430}."] = "从{area:10}沿路向东，穿过{zone:1430}进入沼泽。{npc:1776}在{area:657}等着，那是{zone:1430}进来的路旁的德莱尼营地。",
	["Follow the road east from {zone:1431} through {zone:1430} into the swamp. {npc:1776} waits at the {area:657}, the draenei camp just off the road where it comes in from {zone:1430}."] = "从{zone:1431}沿路向东，经过{zone:1430}进入沼泽。{npc:1776}在{area:657}等候；那是靠近{zone:1430}入口、道路旁的德莱尼营地。",
	["Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals.\nCareful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp."] = "再往北，风险投资公司的地精在道路东侧矿场挖掘；矿工、工头、勘探员和工匠都会掉落水晶。\n小心：营地周围有潜行的深喉猎豹和荆棘谷雌虎游荡。",
	["Gringer, the flight master, waits on {area:35}'s upper deck. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn."] = "飞行管理员格林戈在{area:35}的上层平台等候。任务给予者分布在海港周围的栈道和旅店里。",
	["Hand Unbagwa the fangs and stay by him: he calls three waves of gorillas, then {npc:1514}. Fight them one at a time."] = "把猩猩牙交给安巴格瓦并待在他身边：他会召唤三波猩猩，然后是{npc:1514}。一次对付一个。",
	["Head east to {area:75}, in the reeds south of the road."] = "向东到{area:75}，在路南的芦苇丛里。",
	["Head east to {area:75}, in the reeds south of the road. Bind here."] = "向东前往{area:75}，就在路南的芦苇丛中。把炉石绑定在这里。",
	["Head north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. {npc:1059} guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all."] = "向北前往风险投资公司矿场以东的劈颅废墟；逐个引出猎头者和狂战士。{npc:1059} 把守着西南边的废墟，废墟北边有一堆战利品头骨。每个劈颅巨魔都可能掉落獠牙或项链：项链比较难凑齐，因此到废墟北边的战士营地继续击杀，直到集齐。",
	["Head north up the road to the hunters' camp."] = "沿路向北前往猎人营地。",
	["Head north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river."] = "沿路向北；猎人们在河流上方的山丘扎营。",
	["Head south to {area:35}. Shaky Phillipe waits on the docks."] = "向南前往 {area:35}。“病鬼”菲利普 在码头等着。",
	["Head west to {object:3202}."] = "向西前往 {object:3202}。",
	["His strongbox waits at his old camp north of {area:75}, on the way back west."] = "他的保险箱在{area:75}北边的旧营地里，向西返程时会经过。",
	["His strongbox waits at his old camp north of {area:75}."] = "他的保险箱在{area:75}北边他原来的营地里。",
	["If you skipped {quest:192} or {quest:195}, grind here to level 42.68 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果跳过了{quest:192}或{quest:195}，在这里刷到42.68级，以保持在路线计划内。",
	["If you skipped {quest:192} or {quest:195}, grind here to level 42.68 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead."] = "如果跳过了{quest:192}或{quest:195}，就在这里刷怪到42.68级，跟上路线的等级规划。也可组队挑战{area:1517}副本。",
	["If you skipped {quest:208}, grind here to level 42.74 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果跳过了{quest:208}，在这里刷到42.74级，以保持在路线计划内。",
	["If you skipped {quest:208}, grind here to level 42.74 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead."] = "如果跳过了{quest:208}，就在这里刷怪到42.74级，跟上路线的等级规划。也可组队挑战{area:1517}副本。",
	["Inside"] = "在里面",
	["Inside {area:1742}"] = "在{area:1742}内部",
	["Into the {area:8}"] = "进入{area:8}",
	["Into the {zone:1435}"] = "进入{zone:1435}",
	["Ironjaw Basilisks"] = "铁腭蜥蜴",
	["Jon-Jon the Crow"] = "乌鸦乔恩乔恩",
	["Jungle Stalker"] = "丛林潜伏者",
	["Jungle Stalkers"] = "丛林捕猎者",
	["Jungle stalkers"] = "丛林捕猎者",
	["Keep going north into {area:10}, then east along the road through {zone:1430} into the swamp. {npc:1776} waits at the {area:657}, the draenei camp near the way in from {zone:1430}."] = "继续向北进入{area:10}，然后沿路向东穿过{zone:1430}进入沼泽。{npc:1776}在{area:657}等着，那是从{zone:1430}进来处附近的德莱尼营地。",
	["Leave town by the tunnel; the note lies in the pirates' cove just north of {area:35}."] = "从隧道出城；信件在{area:35}正北的海盗海湾里。",
	["Level 42.68"] = "等级 42.68",
	["Level 42.74"] = "等级 42.74",
	["MacKinley, on the top floor: for Stoley in {zone:1446}"] = "顶层的“海狼”马克基雷：交给{zone:1446}的斯杜雷",
	["Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins"] = "“畸形脚”莫里·威尔金斯",
	["Mistvale gorillas"] = "迷雾谷猩猩",
	["Naga Explorer"] = "纳迦探险者",
	["Nesingwary's camp"] = "奈辛瓦里的营地",
	["Noboru the Cudgel"] = "棍棒诺博鲁",
	["Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the {area:76}; his cudgel starts a quest."] = "木棒诺博鲁在{area:76}西南的空地上游荡；他的木棒可以开始一个任务。",
	["North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture."] = "在迷雾谷东北，赞吉尔的追随者在丛林里扎营；他们每个人都可能携带赞吉尔的药剂。",
	["Optional, and tough at 41: the scroll, {quest:624}, lies on the decks of the three ships off the {area:43}, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs. Take it only if you can pull the crew to the rail one at a time, or with a friend; its chain runs on through the {area:8}, {zone:1445} and the {zone:1425}."] = "可选，41级时较难：卷轴{quest:624}放在{area:43}外三艘船的甲板上，船上是成对出现的42-45级海盗。只有当你能把船员一个个引到船舷边，或带上一个朋友时才去拿；它的任务链还会继续到{area:8}、{zone:1445}和{zone:1425}。",
	["Optional, and tough at 41: the scroll, {quest:624}, lies on the decks of the three ships off the {area:43}, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs. Take it only if you can pull the crew to the rail one at a time, or with a friend; its chain runs on through the {zone:1435}, {zone:1445} and the {zone:1425}."] = "可选任务，41级时难度很高：卷轴{quest:624}位于{area:43}外海三艘船的甲板上，船上的海盗为42-45级，常成对行动。只有能把船员逐只引到船舷边，或有朋友同行时才去取；后续任务会经过{zone:1435}、{zone:1445}和{zone:1425}。",
	["Pirate ghosts"] = "海盗幽灵",
	["Raptors: Zjolnir, beside {npc:7953} in {area:367}."] = "迅猛龙：佐尔尼尔，在{area:367}的{npc:7953}旁边。",
	["Ride back east past {area:75} and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore."] = "向东骑回{area:75}，沿道路向东南前往岸边的部落小哨站。",
	["Ride north out of {area:35} along the road; the basilisks bask on the rocks east of it in the middle of the jungle, on the way back to {object:3202}. Their shards drop often."] = "从{area:35}沿路向北骑；蜥蜴在丛林中部、路东的岩石上晒太阳，就在回{object:3202}的路上。它们的碎片掉得很勤。",
	["Ride north-east to the {area:76}. The crystals stand along the way up to {npc:5391}'s cage."] = "向东北骑往{area:76}。水晶分布在通往{npc:5391}笼子的路上。",
	["Ride on north to {object:3202}."] = "继续向北骑到{object:3202}。",
	["Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the {area:657}, near the way in from {zone:1430}."] = "沿道路向西骑往{area:657}的德莱尼营地，靠近{zone:1430}的入口。",
	["Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the {area:657}, near the way in from {zone:1430}. {quest:698} goes to {npc:5592} at {area:1978} on the next swamp visit: keep the flanks."] = "沿路骑行向西，前往{area:657}的德莱尼营地，靠近从{zone:1430}过来的入口。{quest:698}留到下次来沼泽时，交给{area:1978}的{npc:5592}；保留鳄鱼肉。",
	["Riding at 40"] = "40级骑术",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:7953} in {area:367} on the {zone:1411} coast, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Another race's trainer (Kildar in {zone:1454}) teaches you only once you are Exalted with his city."] = "骑术需要40级，花费100金；学会后会送你一只坐骑。每个种族在自己种族的训练师那里学习：你的是{zone:1411}海岸{area:367}的{npc:7953}，他旁边还有佐尔尼尔的迅猛龙（每只20金）。其他种族的训练师（{zone:1454}的基尔达）只在你对他的城市达到崇拜后才会教你。",
	["Sawtooth crocolisks"] = "盐齿鳄鱼",
	["Skullsplitter Berserker"] = "劈颅者狂战士",
	["Skullsplitter Headhunter"] = "劈颅者猎头者",
	["Skullsplitter Hunter"] = "劈颅者猎人",
	["Skullsplitter warriors"] = "劈颅战士",
	["South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the {area:43}; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and {npc:2493}'s eye, so keep killing until you have both."] = "在藏宝海湾南边，血帆流氓在{area:43}扎营；血帆海图和血帆计划书就在他们的帐篷里。任何血帆海盗都可能携带鼻烟和{npc:2493}的眼睛，所以一直杀到两样都拿到为止。",
	["South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the {area:43}; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and {npc:2493}'s eye, so keep killing until you have both.\nTake the road south towards {area:35}. The Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40-41) live in {area:1737}, east of the road; about one in twenty carries an aged sinew."] = "藏宝海湾以南，血帆剑客在{area:43}扎营；海图和命令就在他们的帐篷里。任何血帆海盗都可能带着鼻烟和{npc:2493}的眼睛，所以一直杀到两样都拿到。\n沿路向南前往{area:35}。年长的薄雾谷猩猩（40-41级）住在路东的{area:1737}；大约二十只里有一只带着陈旧肌腱。",
	["Take the road north out of {area:35}; Unbagwa sits on a hill in {area:1737}, east of the road."] = "沿道路向北离开{area:35}；安巴格瓦坐在道路东边{area:1737}的一座山丘上。",
	["The Bloodsail ships"] = "血帆海盗船",
	["The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of {object:3202}. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights."] = "丛林捕猎者（40-41级）在{object:3202}南边的海岸捕猎。它们比你高得多：一次引一只，战斗间隙休息。",
	["The boat lands in {area:35}'s harbour. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn."] = "船停靠在{area:35}的港口。任务给予者站在港口周围的木栈道上和旅店里。",
	["The crocolisks wallow in the pools around {npc:5391}'s camp and south towards {area:75}; about one in four drops a flank."] = "鳄鱼在{npc:5391}营地周围的水塘里打滚，一直到南边的{area:75}；大约四分之一会掉落鳄鱼肉。",
	["The crocolisks wallow in the pools around {npc:5391}'s camp and south towards {area:75}; about one in four drops a flank.\nCareful: {npc:5592}'s camp sits by the coast. Along the way to it you pass level 40 spiders that chase a long distance, plus stealthed Shadow Panthers."] = "鳄鱼在{npc:5391}营地周围的水池里以及往南到{area:75}一带打滚；大约四只掉一块腹肉。\n注意：{npc:5592}的营地就在海边。去那里的路上会经过40级的蜘蛛，它们会追很远，还有潜行的暗影豹。",
	["The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang."] = "猩猩在安巴格瓦周围的山谷里游荡。老迈的猩猩掉落内脏；任何猩猩都可能掉落猩猩牙。",
	["The next guide flies you north to {area:272} and into the {zone:1417}."] = "下一份攻略会带你向北飞到{area:272}，进入{zone:1417}。",
	["The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp.\nThe last skulls are in the ruins a short walk west, on the way back to {object:3202}."] = "下一堆颅骨堆在战士营地正北的小废墟里。\n最后的颅骨堆在西边不远的废墟里，走几步就到，就在回{object:3202}的路上。",
	["The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of {object:3202}, out towards the west coast."] = "丛林捕猎者迅猛龙在{object:3202}南边的丛林里捕猎，一直到西海岸。",
	["The three ghostly pirates haunt the jungle north of {area:35}, near Zanzil's camps: {npc:2535} and {npc:2536} stand together, {npc:2537} further east."] = "三个海盗幽灵在{area:35}北边、赞吉尔营地附近的丛林里出没：{npc:2535}和{npc:2536}站在一起，{npc:2537}在更东边。",
	["The three ships lie off the {area:43}. The crews are 42-45, Stillwater 45, Keelhaul 46 and {npc:2546} 48: at 41 this is a fight for a group, or for the end of the guide. If you go, swim out and pull the crew to the rail one at a time. A scroll, {quest:624}, lies on the ships' decks: take it."] = "三艘船停在{area:43}外的海面上。船员是42-45级，斯蒂沃特船长45级，尼哈鲁船长46级，{npc:2546}48级：41级时这是小队的战斗，或者留到本指南结束时再来。如果要去，就游过去，把船员一个个引到船舷边。船的甲板上有一张卷轴{quest:624}：拿上它。",
	["The {area:43}"] = "{area:43}",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:728} is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{npc:728}是 40 级精英，多数职业到 42 级可以尝试单独击败，但可能仍需帮助。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:730} is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{npc:730}是 43 级精英，多数职业到 45 级可以尝试单独击败，但可能仍需帮助。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:731} is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nCareful: Tigers and stealthed shadowmaw panthers roam close to him. Clear them before you pull him. When he is pulled, {npc:731} calls for help from creatures within 20 yd."] = "这些是精英敌人，建议寻找其他玩家组队完成。{npc:731}是 43 级精英，多数职业到 45 级可以尝试单独击败，但可能仍需帮助。独自一人时可跳过，路线会安排刷怪补回经验。\n注意：附近有老虎和潜行的暗影黑豹，先清理再拉首领。拉到{npc:731}时，它会召集 20 码内的生物支援。",
	["To {area:392}"] = "前往{area:392}",
	["Venture Co. mine"] = "风险投资公司矿洞",
	["West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs {npc:1061} and {npc:1062} stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them."] = "在远征队营地西边，血顶酋长{npc:1061}和{npc:1062}一起站在祖昆达废墟里。先清掉他们的守卫，再引他们。",
	["West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs {npc:1061} and {npc:1062} stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them. Stay on the Bloodscalps here until level 41: {quest:586}, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead."] = "在远征队营地西边，血顶酋长{npc:1061}和{npc:1062}一起站在祖昆达废墟里。先清掉他们的守卫，再引他们。在这里把血顶巨魔刷到41级：接下来大锅旁的{quest:586}会派你去打41-43级的劈颅者。或者组队改去打{area:1517}副本。",
	["West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs {npc:1061} and {npc:1062} stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them. Stay on the Bloodscalps here until level 41: {quest:586}, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43. Or, with a group, run the {area:1517} dungeon instead.\nOn the coast between Zul'Kunda and {object:3202} an {npc:2635} (level 38 elite) shares the spawns of the ordinary crocolisks: kill it if it is up and take its skin for {npc:2495}."] = "远征队西边，血顶酋长{npc:1061}和{npc:1062}一起待在祖昆达废墟。先清掉卫兵，再引他们。在这里继续击杀血顶巨魔直到41级：下一站大锅处的{quest:586}会让你去对付41-43级的劈颅巨魔。也可组队挑战{area:1517}副本。\n在祖昆达废墟和{object:3202}之间的海岸上，{npc:2635}（38级精英）与普通鳄鱼共享刷新点：如果它在，就击杀它并拿走它的皮交给{npc:2495}。",
	["You start in {area:75}. Bind here: you hearth back after the coast."] = "你从{area:75}开始。在这里绑定炉石：海岸那边结束后炉石回来。",
	["Zanzil's camps"] = "赞吉尔的营地",
	["Zul'Kunda"] = "祖昆达废墟",
	["Zul'Mamwe"] = "祖玛维废墟",
	["for Stoley in {zone:1446}; on the top floor"] = "给{zone:1446}的斯托雷；在顶层",
	["for a later stop in the {area:8}"] = "为之后在{area:8}的一站准备",
	["for a later stop in the {zone:1435}"] = "留到之后在{zone:1435}停留时",
	["from the {object:52}, in the ruins"] = "来自{object:52}，在废墟里",
	["grind on the Bloodscalps here: {quest:586}, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43"] = "在这里刷血顶巨魔升级：下一站大锅处的{quest:586}会让你去对付41-43级的劈颅巨魔",
	["grind on {npc:667}"] = "击杀{npc:667}刷经验",
	["the Drowned City's entrance, underwater"] = "沉没之城的入口，位于水下",
	["the {object:2076}"] = "{object:2076}",
	["the {object:2076} again: Yenniku's fate"] = "又是{object:2076}：耶尼库的命运",
	["the {object:2076}, beside Nimboya"] = "{object:2076}，宁博亚旁边",
	["the {object:2076}, beside {npc:2497}"] = "{object:2076}，在{npc:2497}旁边",
	["{area:127}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:127}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:1577}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1577}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:1737}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:1737}：遇到就杀",
	["{area:340} flight master"] = "{area:340}的飞行管理员",
	["{area:35} flight master"] = "{area:35}飞行管理员",
	["{area:75} flight master"] = "{area:75}飞行管理员",
	["{npc:1442}, upstairs"] = "{npc:1442}：在楼上",
	["{npc:1443}, on the top floor"] = "{npc:1443}，位于最顶层",
	["{npc:2488}, on the top floor"] = "{npc:2488}，位于最顶层",
	["{npc:2491}, in the inn: his bottles wash up on the {zone:1425} coast, around level 48"] = "{npc:2491}，在旅店里：他的酒瓶冲到{zone:1425}海岸上，大约48级",
	["{npc:2495}, inside: the {item:4105}"] = "{npc:2495}，在屋内：交还{item:4105}",
	["{npc:2495}: the Snapjaw skins gathered earlier; inside"] = "{npc:2495}：交还之前收集的钳嘴龟皮；他在屋内",
	["{npc:2495}: the {npc:2635} suns on the coast between Zul'Kunda and {object:3202}, later on this loop"] = "{npc:2495}：{npc:2635}在祖昆达废墟和{object:3202}之间的海岸上晒太阳，本轮路线稍后会经过",
	["{npc:2496}, on the balcony beside MacKinley"] = "{npc:2496}，在马克基雷旁边的阳台上",
	["{npc:2497}: for the {zone:1425}, around level 48"] = "{npc:2497}：留到约48级去{zone:1425}时完成",
	["{npc:2498}, inside"] = "{npc:2498}：在屋内",
	["{npc:2519}: the basilisks graze beside the road back from {area:35}"] = "{npc:2519}：蜥蜴在从{area:35}回来的路边吃草",
	["{npc:2519}: the cavern entrance under the {area:104}, west of the camp"] = "{npc:2519}：洞穴入口在营地西边的{area:104}下方",
	["{npc:2519}: the legend lies in Zul'Kunda, where this guide goes for {npc:1061}"] = "{npc:2519}：传说在祖尔昆达，本指南会为{npc:1061}去那里",
	["{npc:2519}: the trophy skulls stand in the Skullsplitter ruins, later on this loop"] = "{npc:2519}：战利品头骨在碎颅巨魔的废墟里，本环线后段",
	["{npc:4631}, on the docks: Gazlowe's letter, if you carry it"] = "码头上的{npc:4631}：如果你带着加兹鲁维的信，交给他",
	["{npc:5391} is held in the {area:76} in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him."] = "{npc:5391}被关在沼泽东北的{area:76}。救出他并跟着他出去，击退追赶他的沼泽生物。",
	["{npc:5591}, inside"] = "{npc:5591}：在屋内",
	["{npc:669} walks around here: look inside the circle on the map"] = "{npc:669}在附近巡逻，请在地图标示的圆圈内寻找",
	["{npc:6807}, upstairs"] = "{npc:6807}：在楼上",
	["{npc:6930}, upstairs"] = "{npc:6930}：在楼上",
	["{npc:737}, upstairs"] = "{npc:737}：在楼上",
	["{npc:737}, upstairs: the tusks come from the Skullsplitters, later on this loop"] = "{npc:737}，在楼上：獠牙来自碎颅巨魔，本环线后段",
	["{npc:773}, upstairs: for {quest:2864} in {area:976}"] = "{npc:773}，在楼上：交给{area:976}的{quest:2864}",
	["{npc:773}: for {quest:2864} in {area:976}; upstairs"] = "{npc:773}：为{area:976}的{quest:2864}；楼上",
	["{npc:7953}, riding trainer"] = "{npc:7953}，骑术训练师",
	["{object:3202} flight master"] = "{object:3202} 的飞行管理员。",
	["{quest:95770}: west of {object:3202}, swim out over the {area:104} and dive to the cavern entrance in the reef; the quest completes as you find it. Leave the cavern for now: the jungle stalkers are south along the coast."] = "{quest:95770}：在{object:3202}西边，游到{area:104}上方，潜入礁石中的洞穴入口；找到入口时任务即完成。暂时不要进入洞穴：丛林捕猎者在沿海岸往南的地方。",
}

G["forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas"] = {
	["Back to {area:976}"] = "回到{area:976}",
	["Fly from {zone:1454} to {area:392}; {npc:6251} stands on the hill above the docks."] = "从{zone:1454}飞往{area:392}；{npc:6251}站在码头上方的山丘上。",
	["Fly to {area:1637}"] = "飞往{area:1637}",
	["Fly to {area:1638}"] = "飞往{area:1638}",
	["Fly to {area:484}"] = "飞往{area:484}",
	["Fly to {area:976}"] = "飞往{area:976}",
	["Fly to {object:3202}"] = "飞往{object:3202}",
	["Fly to {zone:1454}. From the flight master: the {object:172960}, then the Drag, then the {object:172958}."] = "飞往 {zone:1454}。从飞行管理员出发：先去 {object:172960}，再去暗巷区，然后去 {object:172958}。",
	["Fly to {zone:1454}. The Droffers brothers run their shop in the Drag.\n{object:172958}, then the {object:172960} and the {object:172961}."] = "飞往{zone:1454}。德罗弗斯兄弟在暗巷区开着店。\n{object:172958}，然后是{object:172960}和{object:172961}。",
	["Gordunni Brute"] = "戈杜尼蛮兵",
	["Gordunni Mauler"] = "戈杜尼重击者",
	["Gordunni Ogre"] = "戈杜尼食人魔",
	["Gordunni Ogre Mage"] = "戈杜尼食人魔法师",
	["Gordunni Shaman"] = "戈杜尼萨满祭司",
	["Gordunni Warlock"] = "戈杜尼术士",
	["Grimtotem camp"] = "恐怖图腾营地",
	["Keep riding west to the coast. The Coast Crawl Deepseers and Snapclaws on the beaches drop OOX-22/FE's distress beacon about one kill in forty: if one drops, use it to start the quest."] = "继续向西骑到海岸。海滩上的海滩龙虾人先知和海滩利爪龙虾人大约每杀四十只掉落一个OOX-22/FE定位器：如果掉了，就使用它开始任务。",
	["Kodos: {npc:3685}, beside {npc:3690} in {area:222}."] = "科多兽：{npc:3685}，在{area:222}的{npc:3690}旁边。",
	["North of the gnolls the ogres hold a hilltop outpost; pull the ogre-magi to you. The cobalt is in the dirt mounds around the outpost, and the scroll lies on the ground inside it."] = "在豺狼人北边，食人魔占据着一座山顶前哨站；把食人魔法师引到你身边来打。戈杜尼钴矿石在前哨站周围的土堆里，戈杜尼卷轴就在前哨站里的地上。",
	["North-west of the ruins, the yetis den in {area:1105}; every yeti there can drop a thick hide."] = "在废墟西北，雪人栖息在{area:1105}；那里的每只雪人都可能掉落厚雪人皮。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: any beast, gnoll or ogre in {area:357} can drop it, about one kill in a hundred; use it to start the quest. The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of {area:1105}, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the {area:1108}; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in {area:35} for a later visit.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock."] = "只有拿到求救信号器才能做：{area:357}里任何野兽、豺狼人或食人魔都可能掉落它，大约每杀一百只出一个；用它开启任务。机器人待在{area:1105}北侧、废墟西北不远处的一个小洞里。护送它到{area:1108}的码头；路上有雪人和猩猩伏击你。奖励留在{area:35}，以后再去领。\n注意：护送途中会刷三波伏击，机器人每次都会提前警告。第一波是3只雪人，在机器人离开山洞爬向大路后；第二波是3只猩猩，在沿悬崖的小路上；第三波约4只豺狼人，其中一只是法系，在路线拐向码头的地方。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: any beast, gnoll or ogre in {zone:1444} can drop it, about one kill in a hundred; use it to start the quest. The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of {area:1105}, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the {area:1108}; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in {area:35} for a later visit.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock."] = "仅当你有定位器时：{zone:1444}的任何野兽、豺狼人或食人魔都可能掉落它，大约每杀一百只掉一个；使用它开始任务。机器人在{area:1105}北侧的一个小山洞里，就在废墟西北不远。护送它到{area:1108}的码头；途中会有雪人和猩猩伏击你。它的奖励在{area:35}，留到之后再去领取。\n小心：护送过程中会出现三次伏击，机器人每次都会提前警告你。第一次是3只雪人，就在机器人离开山洞、爬向道路之后。第二次是3只猩猩，在沿悬崖延伸的小路上。第三次是大约4个豺狼人，其中一个是施法者，在路线转向码头的地方。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits in a small cave on the north side of {area:1105}. Escort it to the dock on the {area:1108}; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in {area:35} for a later visit.\nCareful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock."] = "只有拿到求救信号器才能做：机器人待在{area:1105}北侧的一个小洞里。护送它到{area:1108}的码头；路上有雪人和猩猩伏击你。奖励留在{area:35}，以后再去领。\n注意：护送途中会刷三波伏击，机器人每次都会提前警告。第一波是3只雪人，在机器人离开山洞爬向大路后；第二波是3只猩猩，在沿悬崖的小路上；第三波约4只豺狼人，其中一只是法系，在路线拐向码头的地方。",
	["Raptors: Zjolnir, beside {npc:7953} in {area:367}."] = "迅猛龙：祖尼尔，在{area:367}的{npc:7953}旁边。",
	["Ride north-east back to the port: {npc:7881}, the {npc:15165} and the Security Chief take what {area:1336} gave you. {area:976} is west of it."] = "向东北骑回港口：{npc:7881}、{npc:15165}和安全主管会收下你从{area:1336}带回的东西。{area:976}就在港口西边。",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin harbour on the coast."] = "向东北骑往海岸边的地精港口。",
	["Ride south-west to the ogre ruins below {area:1105}. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb."] = "向西南骑往{area:1105}下方的食人魔废墟。里面满是戈杜尼萨满祭司、戈杜尼术士和戈杜尼虐待者；南端的戈杜尼大法师携带宝珠。",
	["Ride west from the hive to the ogre ruins below {area:1105}. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb."] = "从虫巢向西骑往{area:1105}下方的食人魔废墟。里面满是戈杜尼萨满祭司、戈杜尼术士和戈杜尼虐待者；南端的戈杜尼大法师携带宝珠。",
	["Riding and Galestriders: {npc:265756}, at the {area:17684} in {area:16638} on Zephras Isle."] = "骑术和疾风陆行鸟：找泽风岛上{area:16638}的{area:17684}处的{npc:265756}。",
	["Riding at 40"] = "40级学骑术",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:3690} in {area:222}, with {npc:3685}'s kodos (20 gold each) beside him. Another race's trainer ({npc:4752} in {zone:1454}) teaches you only once you are Exalted with his city."] = "骑术需要40级，花费100金；学会即获得坐骑。每个种族向本族的训练师学习：你的是{area:222}的{npc:3690}，旁边是{npc:3685}的科多兽（每头20金）。其他种族的训练师（{zone:1454}的{npc:4752}）只在你与其主城声望崇拜后才教你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:3690} in {area:222}, with {npc:3685}'s kodos (20 gold each) beside him. Ride back up to {zone:1456}'s flight master afterwards."] = "骑术需要40级，花费100金币；学会后会获得一只坐骑。各个种族都要找本族训练师学习。你的训练师是{area:222}的{npc:3690}，旁边是{npc:3685}出售的科多兽（每只20金币）。之后骑回上方{zone:1456}的飞行管理员处。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:4773} in {area:159}, with {npc:4731}'s skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Another race's trainer ({npc:4752} in {zone:1454}) teaches you only once you are Exalted with his city."] = "骑术需要40级，花费100金；学会即获得坐骑。每个种族向本族的训练师学习：你的是{area:159}的{npc:4773}，旁边是{npc:4731}的骸骨军马（每匹20金）。其他种族的训练师（{zone:1454}的{npc:4752}）只在你与其主城声望崇拜后才教你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is {npc:7953} in {area:367}, a short ride south of {zone:1454} down the {zone:1411} road, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Ride back to {zone:1454}'s flight master afterwards."] = "骑术需要40级，花费100金币；学会后会获得一只坐骑。各个种族都要找本族训练师学习。你的训练师是{area:367}的{npc:7953}，从{zone:1454}沿{zone:1411}的道路向南骑行不远就到，旁边是Zjolnir出售的迅猛龙（每只20金币）。之后骑回{zone:1454}的飞行管理员处。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. {npc:4752} teaches Orcs in the {object:172958}, by {npc:3362}'s kennel. Skyborne learn it from {npc:265756} at the {area:17684} in {area:16638} on Zephras Isle, with a Galestrider: the skyboat to the isle leaves the cliffs south of {area:17045}, north of {zone:1456}, about every five minutes. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each."] = "骑术需要40级，费用100金币；学习时会获得一只坐骑。兽人可在{object:172958}、{npc:3362}的兽栏旁向{npc:4752}学习。天裔可在泽风岛{area:16638}的{area:17684}向{npc:265756}学习，并获得一只疾风陆行鸟：前往该岛的空中船约每5分钟从{area:17045}南面、{zone:1456}北面的悬崖出发。你所属种族的其他坐骑每只20金币：“收藏品”中的“坐骑 · 40级”提供各类指南。",
	["Skeletal horses: {npc:4731}, beside {npc:4773} in {area:159}."] = "骸骨军马：{npc:4731}，在{area:159}的{npc:4773}旁边。",
	["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. {npc:7883} and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with {npc:7883}, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts."] = "沿海岸向南，南海海盗占据着海湾。{npc:7883} 和失窃货物位于海湾最里面的码头上。任何海盗都有可能掉帽子，绑匪的掉率最高。\n小心：{npc:7883} 身旁有两三名海盗，开战后镇内还会有更多海盗加入。",
	["Southsea Dock Worker"] = "南海码头工人",
	["Southsea Freebooter"] = "南海劫掠者",
	["Southsea Pirate"] = "南海海盗",
	["Southsea Swashbuckler"] = "南海剑客",
	["The Grimtotem tauren camp beside the sprite darters' grove; raiders, naturalists and shamans all carry horns."] = "恐怖图腾牛头人在小精龙的树林旁扎营；恐怖图腾袭击者、恐怖图腾博学者和恐怖图腾萨满祭司都携带恐怖图腾之角。",
	["The Woodpaw gnolls camp in the hills just north-west of Mojache; any of them can drop a mane.\nCareful: Every Woodpaw gnoll except the Alpha runs off for help at 15% health, which can pull more gnolls into the fight."] = "木爪豺狼人在莫沙彻西北不远处的山丘扎营；所有种类都可能掉落鬃毛。\n小心：除首领外，所有木爪豺狼人都会在15%生命值时逃跑求援，可能将更多豺狼人引入战斗。",
	["The Zukk'ash hive burrows into the hills south-east of the camp; {quest:7731} waits in its deepest chamber."] = "祖卡什异种蝎的巢穴深入营地东南的山丘；{quest:7731}在最深处的洞室里等候。",
	["The bandits and thieves camp in the dunes east of {area:976}. Every Wastewander can carry a water pouch: keep ten, five for each of Luglunket's bounties.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues (level 43-44) move stealthed, so they can approach unseen."] = "强盗和盗贼在{area:976}东侧沙丘扎营。所有废土敌人都可能携带水袋：保留十个，操作员鲁格伦克的两个悬赏各需五个。\n小心：废土游荡者（43-44级）会潜行移动，可能悄悄靠近。",
	["The battle map lies in the Woodpaw camp south of Mojache."] = "木爪作战地图在莫沙彻营地南边的木爪营地里。",
	["The middle of {zone:1454}"] = "{zone:1454}中部",
	["The road from {area:484} to {zone:1446} runs past the {area:2240} on the {area:439}: {npc:4454} is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, {npc:4630} and {npc:4709} by the goblins' camp. {npc:4630} first, then {npc:4709}, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to {npc:4630}."] = "从{area:484}到{zone:1446}的路经过{area:439}上的{area:2240}：{npc:4454}在赛道旁的侏儒营地里，{npc:4630}和{npc:4709}在地精营地旁。先找{npc:4630}，再找{npc:4709}——他会跑开去缠住里兹尔；然后从侏儒营地拿到里兹尔的计划，带回去交给{npc:4630}。",
	["The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of {area:976}.\nSouth-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; {npc:7847} stands in the eastern camp.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\nCareful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them."] = "暗影法师、潜行者和刺客驻扎在 {area:976} 东南。\n加基森东南的沙丘中有废土强盗营地；{npc:7847} 站在东边的营地里。\n小心：废土游荡者脱战后会保持潜行，在营地开战时，隐藏的游荡者可能加入战斗。\n小心：他无论走到哪里，都有两名潜行的废土游荡者同行。在刷新营地时，附近的两名暗影法师及其爪牙也会被引来。到塔楼附近就能单独与他战斗，避开这些法师。",
	["The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of Mojache; nearly every one drops a wing. The Woodpaw alphas lead the camps south-west of it: kill them within the hour.\nCareful: Most Alphas sit in small tent camps with 2-4 other gnolls that join the fight, and other gnolls patrol between the camps."] = "精龙在莫沙彻西侧紧邻的林地上方飞舞；几乎每只都会掉落翅膀。木爪豺狼人首领率领着其西南方各营地：要在一小时内杀死它们。\n小心：大多数首领都待在小帐篷营地中，旁边有 2-4 只会加入战斗的豺狼人，营地之间还有其他豺狼人巡逻。",
