	["{area:16635} turn-ins"] = "{area:16635}交任务",
	["{area:16663} is west of {area:16638} along the coast road."] = "{area:16663}在{area:16638}西边，沿海岸道路前往。",
	["{area:380} is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "{area:380}是本攻略的大本营。你需要的所有人都在旅店几步之内。",
	["{item:251924}: the Al'Aketh in {npc:252095}'s camp carry it"] = "{item:251924}：{npc:252095}营地的奥拉凯斯携带此物",
	["{item:253591} along the way to {npc:252800}"] = "{item:253591}，在去{npc:252800}的路上",
	["{item:257128} cones grow south of the hermit; the Wind Hollows drift east of the lake and also drop the Wind Hollow Essences for {npc:254344}'s {quest:93736}. The refugees' belongings lie along the north shore of {area:16625}; {npc:259013} is at its north-west end."] = "{item:257128}的球果生长在隐士南边；风之空灵在湖的东边飘荡，它们也会掉落{npc:254344}的{quest:93736}所需的风之空灵精华。难民的财物散落在{area:16625}北岸；{npc:259013}在北岸西北端。",
	["{item:257128} on the way"] = "{item:257128}，顺路",
	["{item:265105} grows around {npc:257944}'s camp and Shriekings fly over it. The Al'Aketh camp east of her holds the {item:265141}."] = "{item:265105}生长在{npc:257944}的营地周围，尖啸幼兽在上空飞行。她东边的奥拉凯斯营地里有{item:265141}。",
	["{item:278079}, from {npc:3014}"] = "{item:278079}，来自{npc:3014}",
	["{item:278080}, from {npc:3012}"] = "{item:278080}，来自{npc:3012}",
	["{item:278081}, from {npc:3005}"] = "{item:278081}，来自{npc:3005}",
	["{item:278083}, from {npc:3027}"] = "{item:278083}，来自{npc:3027}",
	["{npc:2127} in {zone:1420}; {area:16638} has no warlock trainer"] = "前往{zone:1420}找{npc:2127}；{area:16638}没有术士训练师",
	["{npc:249363} stands at the {area:17678}, east of the village. {npc:251143} and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her. The {object:460001} is just north-east of her: cast your {spell:1259686} racial ability next to it."] = "{npc:249363}站在村子东边的{area:17678}。{npc:251143}和{npc:251160}聚集在她北边不远处。{object:460001}就在她东北方：在它旁边施放你的种族技能{spell:1259686}。",
	["{npc:250926} prowl the slopes south-west of the village, on the way to {npc:252095}.\nThe Ursera den is west of the village. {npc:251115}, their matriarch, sits at its far end."] = "{npc:250926}在村子西南面的山坡游荡，前往{npc:252095}途中会经过。\n乌萨拉食腐者巢穴位于村子西面。它们的族母{npc:251115}待在巢穴最深处。",
	["{npc:251361}'s errands"] = "{npc:251361}的差事",
	["{npc:251361}: a note from your trainer"] = "{npc:251361}：训练师给你的便条",
	["{npc:251361}: examine the {item:282418}"] = "{npc:251361}：查看{item:282418}",
	["{npc:251361}: read the {item:9547}"] = "{npc:251361}：阅读{item:9547}",
	["{npc:251361}: the {item:4100}"] = "{npc:251361}：{item:4100}",
	["{npc:251373}, the druid trainer, on the ground floor of the tree behind {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251373}，德鲁伊训练师，在{npc:251361}身后那棵树的底层",
	["{npc:251374}, beside {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251374}，在{npc:251361}旁边",
	["{npc:251374}: {npc:5873} and your {item:5175}"] = "{npc:251374}：{npc:5873}和你的{item:5175}",
	["{npc:251376}, beside {npc:251361}"] = "{npc:251376}，在{npc:251361}旁边",
	["{npc:251389}, in the watchtower"] = "{npc:251389}，在瞭望塔里",
	["{npc:251523} waits in {area:16624} for what you found in the wardrobe."] = "{npc:251523}在{area:16624}等你带回衣柜里找到的东西。",
	["{npc:251905}, {npc:251906}, {npc:251991}, {npc:252172} and {npc:251523} all stand in {area:16624}. If you are still short of {item:5469}, the Galestriders graze just south of the village."] = "{npc:251905}、{npc:251906}、{npc:251991}、{npc:252172} 和 {npc:251523} 都在 {area:16624}。如果 {item:5469} 还不够，疾风陆行鸟就在村子正南边吃草。",
	["{npc:251905}: Camping 101 asks you to learn it"] = "{npc:251905}：露营 101 要求你学习这项技能",
	["{npc:251964}, in the watchtower"] = "{npc:251964}，在瞭望塔里",
	["{npc:251968} sends you on to Kalimdor. Once you have trained, board the skycutter at the dock on {area:16638}'s south-west edge: it flies to northern {zone:1412}, where {npc:259119} waits."] = "{npc:251968} 会让你继续前往卡利姆多。学好技能后，到 {area:16638} 西南边缘的码头登上空艇：它会飞往 {zone:1412} 北部，{npc:259119} 在那里等候。",
	["{npc:252095} waits in {area:16622}, south-west of the village. The Al'Aketh camp is just beyond her; {npc:256935} leads it.\nCareful: {npc:256935} casts shocks; drag him clear of the other cultists before fighting so they don't join in."] = "{npc:252095} 在村庄西南面的 {area:16622} 等候。奥拉凯斯营地就在她后方不远，由 {npc:256935} 领导。\n小心：{npc:256935} 会施放震击；开战前把他拉离其他教徒，免得它们加入战斗。",
	["{npc:252359} stands on {area:16638}'s east side. {npc:255853} waits by the falls just north of the {area:17675}: leave town to the north, climb the ridge east of the road and glide down to him with {spell:1259416}."] = "{npc:252359} 站在 {area:16638} 东侧。{npc:255853} 在 {area:17675} 正北的瀑布旁等着：从北边离城，爬上道路东边的山脊，再用 {spell:1259416} 滑翔下去找他。",
	["{npc:252377} stands beside {npc:256083}, just north-west of {area:16638}."] = "{npc:252377}站在{npc:256083}旁，就在{area:16638}西北方不远。",
	["{npc:252377}, beside {npc:256083}: {quest:94003}"] = "{npc:252377}，在 {npc:256083} 身边：{quest:94003}",
	["{npc:252382}, beside {npc:251968}: {quest:97243}"] = "{npc:252382}，在 {npc:251968} 身边：{quest:97243}",
	["{npc:252382}: {npc:2523}, your {item:5176} and the {item:263412}"] = "{npc:252382}：{npc:2523}、你的{item:5176}和{item:263412}",
	["{npc:252383}, upstairs"] = "{npc:252383}：在楼上",
	["{npc:252389} takes back the first {item:15908} and hands you two more, one at a time: Ornery Galestriders and Vuldren Alphas roam the fields just north of her. Tame each with its rod and bring the rod back to her. {npc:254411}, beside her, teaches {spell:5149}."] = "{npc:252389}会收回第一根{item:15908}，再依次给你另外两根。暴躁的疾风陆行鸟和瓦尔德伦头狼在她北侧田野活动，用对应驯服棒分别驯服，再将棒交还给她。她身旁的{npc:254411}教授{spell:5149}。",
	["{npc:252389}, a few steps west of {npc:257006}: {quest:94978}, the first rod"] = "{npc:252389}，在 {npc:257006} 西侧几步处：{quest:94978}，第一根驯兽棒。",
	["{npc:252448} and {npc:256083}"] = "{npc:252448}和{npc:256083}",
	["{npc:252476}, upstairs"] = "{npc:252476}：在楼上",
	["{npc:252802} along the way to {npc:252800}"] = "{npc:252802}，在去{npc:252800}的路上",
	["{npc:253372}, inside"] = "{npc:253372}：在屋内",
	["{npc:253590}, upstairs"] = "{npc:253590}：在楼上",
	["{npc:253622}, {npc:258130} and {npc:258134} are in the cult camp east of {npc:257944}. {npc:254151} stands at its edge. Haalien also drops a {quest:94490}: read it to start the next quest. For {quest:94489}, enter the Nightfang Den, heal 7 injured druids and find {npc:258130}."] = "{npc:253622}、{npc:258130}和{npc:258134}在{npc:257944}东边的教派营地里。{npc:254151}站在营地边缘。指挥官哈利恩还会掉落{quest:94490}：阅读它开始下一个任务。完成{quest:94489}：进入夜牙兽穴，治疗7名受伤的德鲁伊并找到{npc:258130}。",
	["{npc:254344}, beside {npc:251968}"] = "{npc:254344}，在{npc:251968}旁边",
	["{npc:254589} lurks south of the village, among the Prideclaws. {npc:254589} is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "{npc:254589}潜伏在村子南边的傲爪之间。{npc:254589}是精英：建议组队。",
	["{npc:256083} stands in the {area:16626} just north-west of town."] = "{npc:256083}站在城镇西北方的{area:16626}。",
	["{npc:256247} waits on the road north of {area:16638}, towards the {area:16629}."] = "{npc:256247}在{area:16638}北边、通往{area:16629}的路上等候。",
	["{npc:257006} and {npc:252448}"] = "{npc:257006}和{npc:252448}",
	["{npc:257006} waits inside a house on {area:16638}'s western edge; {npc:252448} is close by."] = "{npc:257006}在{area:16638}西缘的房屋内等候，{npc:252448}就在附近。",
	["{npc:257006}, inside"] = "{npc:257006}：在屋内",
	["{npc:257196} holds the {item:263993} on the west side of the shrine."] = "{npc:257196}在神殿西侧守着{item:263993}。",
	["{npc:257554} and {npc:263113} stand at the top of the watchtower, a few steps north-east of {npc:251368}."] = "{npc:257554}和{npc:263113}站在瞭望塔顶层，就在{npc:251368}东北边几步远处。",
	["{npc:257944} again"] = "再次找{npc:257944}",
	["{npc:257944}, last time"] = "最后一次找{npc:257944}",
	["{npc:258443} has her lair in a cave in the bluffs just south of the turncoat's house, where the {area:16623} meet the {area:16626}."] = "{npc:258443}的巢穴在叛徒房屋南侧崖壁的洞穴里，位于{area:16623}与{area:16626}交界处。",
	["{npc:259118}, by the landing: for {npc:3033} in {zone:1456}"] = "{npc:259118}，在降落处旁：交给{zone:1456}的{npc:3033}",
	["{npc:259119}: keep it, Thrall in {zone:1454} comes two guides later"] = "{npc:259119}：先留着，两份指南后到{zone:1454}交给萨尔",
	["{npc:259119}: keep it: Thrall in {zone:1454}, at the start of the next guide"] = "{npc:259119}：保留任务，下篇指南开始时交给{zone:1454}的萨尔",
	["{npc:260628}, upstairs"] = "{npc:260628}，在楼上",
	["{npc:263664}'s campfire"] = "{npc:263664}的营火",
	["{npc:268592}, at the Shrine of Flames just south-east of the orchard"] = "{npc:268592}，位于果园东南侧的火焰神殿",
	["{npc:268602}, on the hill west of the falls just north of the watchtower"] = "{npc:268602}，位于瞭望塔北侧瀑布以西的山丘",
	["{npc:269068} wants tauren incense: buy its four parts from {npc:3014} the herbalist, {npc:3012} the enchanting supplier, {npc:3005} the leatherworking supplier and {npc:3027} the cooking supplier, then combine them into {item:278078}."] = "{npc:269068}想要牛头人熏香：从草药商{npc:3014}、附魔供应商{npc:3012}、制皮供应商{npc:3005}和烹饪供应商{npc:3027}处购买四种材料，然后合成{item:278078}。",
	["{npc:3033} trains druids on {area:1639}. He teaches you {spell:18960}; {npc:11802}'s welcome waits for your {spell:499} trip at about 21 (forever/horde/02-the-barrens)."] = "{npc:3033}在{area:1639}训练德鲁伊。他会教你{spell:18960}；{npc:11802}的迎接任务留到约21级、为{spell:499}出行时再做（forever/horde/02-the-barrens）。",
	["{npc:3033} trains druids on {area:1639}. He teaches you {spell:18960}; {npc:11802}'s welcome waits for your {spell:499} trip at about 23 (forever/horde/04-the-barrens)."] = "{npc:3033}在{area:1639}训练德鲁伊。他教你{spell:18960}；{npc:11802}的任务等你23级左右用{spell:499}旅行时再去拜访（forever/horde/04-the-barrens）。",
	["{npc:3449}: the harpies come later, in the {area:383}"] = "{npc:3449}：鹰身人稍后才会遇到，在{area:383}",
	["{npc:5543} stands in the {area:2197}, the cave under {area:1640}: go down inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:5543}站在{area:1640}下方的洞穴{area:2197}里：要进入洞内往下走，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["{quest:92529} lies south of Shen'dar. {npc:257065} meets you at its edge; search the wardrobe in the house behind him."] = "{quest:92529}在申达尔村南边。{npc:257065}在村边与你会合；搜查他身后房子里的衣柜。",
	["{zone:1454}'s {object:172982}"] = "{zone:1454}的{object:172982}",
}

G["forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore"] = {
	["/sit by Kaga's campfire until you get {spell:1229451}"] = "在卡加的营火旁/sit，直到获得{spell:1229451}",
	["Adult Plainstrider"] = "成年平原陆行鸟",
	["Back east to {area:358}: the Bristleback Shamans stand among the quilboar there."] = "向东返回{area:358}：{npc:2953}站在那里的野猪人中间。",
	["Back north-west up to {area:221}."] = "向西北返回{area:221}。",
	["Back south-east to the {area:396}."] = "向东南返回{area:396}。",
	["Back to {area:17}"] = "回到{area:17}",
	["Back to {npc:5888} in the camp. The {npc:5891} waits on the mesa east of the camp: drink the {item:6635} there to see it, then take the {item:6656} back to the Seer."] = "回到营地找{npc:5888}。{npc:5891}在营地东边的台地上等候：在那里喝下{item:6635}以看到它，然后把{item:6656}带回给先知。",
	["Back west to the camp."] = "向西返回营地。",
	["Battleboars graze north of the shrine; the Bristleback quilboar hold the ravine to the north-east. {npc:8554} stands at its eastern end, and the {object:3076} lies on the ground in the camp."] = "斗猪在神龛北边吃草；刺背野猪人占据着东北方的峡谷。{npc:8554}站在峡谷东端，{object:3076}在营地的地上。",
	["Below ground"] = "在地下",
	["Bristleback Interloper"] = "刺背闯入者",
	["Cast {spell:18960}. {npc:11802} is in {area:2361}; the {quest:5930} sits in the north-western woods. {npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "施放{spell:18960}。{npc:11802}在{area:2361}；{quest:5930}在西北方的树林里。{npc:11802}站在他所在建筑的楼上：走进去上楼，箭头无法区分楼层。",
	["Class trainer"] = "职业训练师",
	["Class turn-in in {area:1638}"] = "在 {area:1638} 交还职业任务",
	["Cross north-west past {zone:1456} to the {area:398} in the far north of {zone:1412}."] = "向西北经过{zone:1456}，到{zone:1412}最北边的{area:398}。",
	["Cross to {area:1639}."] = "穿过去到{area:1639}。",
	["Deathskip to {area:220}"] = "通过死亡赶路前往{area:220}",
	["Die to the mobs at 63.7,78.4 ({npc:2954}): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the {npc:6491}'s resurrection."] = "让63.7,78.4处的怪物（{npc:2954}）杀死你：在那里死亡会将你送到这座墓地。释放灵魂并接受 {npc:6491} 的复活。",
	["Follow the path south out of camp to the Seer's tent at the foot of the hills."] = "沿小路向南离开营地，到山脚下灰舌先知的帐篷。",
	["Follow the road north out of {area:220}. {npc:265810} waits on the road just south of {area:222}; /sit by her campfire until you get {spell:1229451}."] = "沿路向北离开{area:220}。{npc:265810}在{area:222}正南方的路边等着；在她篝火旁 /坐下，直到获得{spell:1229451}。",
	["Follow the road north out of {area:220}. {npc:265810} waits on the road just south of {area:222}; /sit by her campfire until you get {spell:1229451}. With a profession learned, Kaga also offers its Camping 101, which its trainer takes: in Bloodhoof or on the {zone:1456} stop."] = "沿道路向北离开{area:220}。{npc:265810}在{area:222}南边不远处的路上等候；在她的营火旁/sit，直到获得{spell:1229451}。学会一项专业后，卡加还会提供对应的露营 101 任务，交给该专业的训练师：在血蹄村或{zone:1456}途中交付。",
	["From the Crossroads follow the road north-east to {area:379}, cross the {area:815} into {zone:1411} and keep north to {area:1637}'s main gate. The next guide starts in {area:1637} and takes the zeppelin to {zone:1420} and {zone:1421}."] = "从十字路口沿道路向东北到{area:379}，穿过{area:815}进入{zone:1411}，再一路向北到{area:1637}的正门。下一份指南从{area:1637}开始，并乘飞艇前往{zone:1420}和{zone:1421}。",
	["From the Crossroads follow the road north-east to {area:379}, cross the {area:815} into {zone:1411} and keep north to {zone:1454}'s main gate. The next guide starts in {zone:1454} and takes the zeppelin to {zone:1420} and {zone:1421}."] = "从十字路口沿道路向东北到{area:379}，跨过{area:815}进入{zone:1411}，继续向北到{zone:1454}正门。下一份指南从{zone:1454}开始，乘飞艇前往{zone:1420}和{zone:1421}。",
	["Galak Centaur"] = "加拉尔半人马",
	["Galak Outrunner"] = "加拉尔奔袭者",
	["Galak centaurs"] = "加拉克半人马",
	["Head north to {area:225}, east of {zone:1456}. {npc:3233} stands at the foot of the rocks; the Bristleback Interlopers dig at the burial ground and the {npc:2994} waits on top."] = "向北到{zone:1456}东边的{area:225}。{npc:3233}站在岩石脚下；{npc:3232}在墓地里挖掘，{npc:2994}在顶上等候。",
	["Inside"] = "在里面",
	["Into {area:17}"] = "进入{area:17}",
	["Into {zone:1412}"] = "进入{zone:1412}",
	["Into {zone:1413}"] = "进入{zone:1413}",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the Crossroads. {npc:3448} stands at the south gate, {quest:860} by the inn, {npc:3615} on the tower platform. {area:380}' own quests come after {zone:1421}, in the {area:17} guide."] = "经东南山口离开{zone:1412}，沿道路到十字路口。{npc:3448}站在南门，{quest:860}在旅店旁，{npc:3615}在塔楼平台上。{area:380}自己的任务排在{zone:1421}之后，在{area:17}指南里。",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the Crossroads. {npc:3448} stands at the south gate, {quest:860} by the inn, {npc:3615} on the tower platform. {area:380}' own quests come after {zone:1421}, in the {zone:1413} guide."] = "从东南方的山口离开{zone:1412}，沿路到十字路口。{npc:3448}在南门，{quest:860}在旅店旁，{npc:3615}在塔楼平台上。{area:380}本地的任务要等去过{zone:1421}后，在{zone:1413}指南中再做。",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the {area:380}. {quest:860} stands by the inn, {npc:3448} at the south gate. {area:17} guide starts here.\n{area:380} is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "从东南山口离开{zone:1412}，沿路前往{area:380}。{quest:860}在旅店旁，{npc:3448}在南门。{area:17}的指南从这里开始。\n{area:380}是本指南的据点。你需要找的人都站在旅店附近几步之内。",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Palemane Poacher"] = "苍白鬃毛偷猎者",
	["Palemane Skinner"] = "苍白鬃毛剥皮者",
	["Palemane Tanner"] = "苍白鬃毛鞣革工",
	["Plainstriders roam the mesa all around the camp: take their meat and feathers on the way back to {npc:2980}."] = "平原陆行鸟在营地周围的台地上游荡：返回{npc:2980}的路上收集它们的肉和羽毛。",
	["Prairie Stalker"] = "草原潜伏者",
	["Prairie Wolf Alphas roam among the wolves on the plains around {npc:275789} and the Galak camp to the east."] = "草原狼前锋在{npc:275789}和东边加拉克营地周围的平原上，混在狼群中游荡。",
	["Prairie Wolves and Adult Plainstriders roam the plains around the village."] = "草原狼和{npc:2956}在村子周围的平原上游荡。",
	["Ride a lift up to the mesas. {npc:2995} keeps the wind riders on the central rise; {npc:3057} stands in the great tent there."] = "乘升降梯上到台地。{npc:2995}在中央台地照看双足飞龙；{npc:3057}站在那里的大帐篷里。",
	["Rogue trainer"] = "潜行者训练师",
	["Spread the {item:278078} off {area:1641}"] = "在{area:1641}散播{item:278078}",
	["Swoop"] = "俯冲者",
	["Swoops glide over the plains all around Bloodhoof."] = "猛鹫在血蹄村周围的平原上空滑翔。",
	["Tame it with the {item:15908}"] = "用{item:15908}驯服它",
	["The Galak centaurs camp on the plains east of the well; Herak leads them."] = "加拉克半人马在井东边的平原扎营；赫拉克率领他们。",
	["The Galak centaurs camp on the plains east of the well; {npc:275767} leads them."] = "加拉克半人马在水井东边的平原上扎营；{npc:275767}是他们的首领。",
	["The Palemane gnolls hold {area:818}, south of the digsite and west of Bloodhoof. {npc:272203} is held in their camp: lead him out."] = "白鬃豺狼人占据着挖掘场南边、血蹄村西边的{area:818}。{npc:272203}被关在他们的营地里：带他出来。",
	["The Seer's tent stands at the foot of the cougars' hills."] = "灰舌先知的帐篷位于山狮所在山丘的山脚下。",
	["The Windfury harpies hold {area:819}, north and west of the well."] = "风怒鹰身人占据着水井北边和西边的{area:819}。",
	["The dwarves of the {area:404} carry the Prospector's Picks. Smash them at the dwarves' forge in the digsite."] = "{area:404}的矮人带着勘察员的锄头。在挖掘场里矮人的熔炉上砸碎它们。",
	["The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. {quest:765} stands in the back of the mine; his {item:281031} start {quest:98424}, and the other pages lie inside the mine."] = "地精在水井东北方的山丘里开矿。{quest:765}站在矿洞深处；他的{item:281031}开始{quest:98424}，其余几页在矿洞里。",
	["The incense burns out in ten minutes: run straight east along the southern hills to the {object:660739}."] = "熏香十分钟就会燃尽：沿南边的山丘一直向东跑到{object:660739}。",
	["The shrine of An'she and Mu'sha"] = "安瑟与穆莎的神龛",
	["The stone stands in the pass out of {zone:1412}, on your way east. Use the {item:15710} there and defeat Lunaclaw."] = "石头在离开{zone:1412}的山口里，就在你向东的路上。在那里使用{item:15710}并击败月爪枭兽。",
	["The well lies north of the village. Adult Plainstriders graze around it: they drop the {item:287505} for Kyle."] = "水井在村子北边。成年平原陆行鸟在水井周围吃草：它们掉落凯尔要的{item:287505}。",
	["The well lies north of the village. Well Stones sit around the well, {object:2912} lies under the trees nearby. Kill wolves, cougars, plainstriders and swoops on the way for {quest:766} and {quest:761}; the plainstriders also drop the {item:287505} for Kyle."] = "水井在村子北边。井石散落在井周围，{object:2912}在附近的树下。沿路杀狼、美洲狮、平原陆行鸟和俯冲者，用于{quest:766}和{quest:761}；平原陆行鸟还会掉落给凯尔的{item:287505}。",
	["The well lies south-east of the village."] = "水井在村子东南方。",
	["The well lies south-east of the village. {npc:2988} camps beside it, and {quest:99079} stands on the {area:821} a little east."] = "水井在村子东南方。{npc:2988}在水井旁扎营，{quest:99079}站在东边不远处的{area:821}上。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies north-west of the centaurs, east of the road to {zone:1456}."] = "被毁的商队在半人马西北方、通往{zone:1456}的道路东边。",
	["The {object:177525}"] = "{object:177525}",
	["To {area:1637}"] = "前往{area:1637}",
	["To {zone:1454}"] = "前往{zone:1454}",
	["Use the {item:278078} at the ceremonial mat and burner on the south-facing cliff of {area:1641}."] = "在{area:1641}朝南的悬崖上，于仪式垫和香炉处使用{item:278078}。",
	["Venture Co. Supervisor"] = "风险投资公司监工",
	["Venture Co. Worker"] = "风险投资公司工人",
	["Warlock trainer"] = "术士训练师",
	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:11869} (10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "顺路提示：向{npc:11869}学习法杖（10 银）；猎人的近战武器主要用于提供属性，双手武器的属性通常更多。",
	["While you're here: learn {spell:199} from {npc:11869} (10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."] = "顺路提示：向{npc:11869}学习{spell:199}（10 银）；战士使用双手武器升级最快。",
	["You start on the mesa of {area:221}. {npc:2980} and the chief stand by the big tent in the middle."] = "你从{area:221}的台地上出发。{npc:2980}和鹰风酋长站在中央的大帐篷旁。",
	["{area:220}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:220}：沿途遇到就击杀",
	["{area:221}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:221}：遇到就击杀",
	["{area:474}: kill these as you meet them"] = "{area:474}：沿途遇到就击杀",
