G["forever/reputation/thunder-bluff"] = {
	["+150"] = "+150",
	["Back to the mine for the workers, supervisors and {quest:765} in the back: his {item:281031} start {quest:98424}, and its other pages lie inside the mine. The Galak centaurs and Herak camp east of the village. Swoops fly all over {zone:1412}; the Windfury harpies roost south-east of the village; the Palemane gnolls camp west of it."] = "回到矿洞找工人、监工和最深处的{quest:765}：他的{item:281031}能开启{quest:98424}，其余书页在矿洞里。加拉克半人马和赫拉克在村子东边扎营。斯沃普斯在{zone:1412}到处飞；风怒鹰身女妖在村子东南栖息；白鬃豺狼人在村子西边扎营。",
	["Back to the mine for the workers, supervisors and {quest:765}. The Galak centaurs and {npc:275767} camp east of the village. Swoops fly all over {zone:1412}; the Windfury harpies roost south-east of the village; the Palemane gnolls camp west of it."] = "回到矿井处理矿工、监工和{quest:765}。加拉克半人马和{npc:275767}在村子东边扎营。猛鹫遍布{zone:1412}各地；风怒鹰身人在村子东南方栖息；白鬃豺狼人在村子西边扎营。",
	["Broodmother Valraxx"] = "育母瓦尔拉克斯",
	["Brumeran"] = "布鲁米兰",
	["Eastern {zone:1412}"] = "{zone:1412} 东部",
	["Exalted with {faction:81}"] = "{faction:81}崇拜",
	["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. The Earthen Ring camp on the {area:17045}, north-west of {faction:81}: 300 {faction:81} reputation in 20 minutes, plus 100 each for {zone:1454} and the Darkspear Trolls and 450 Earthen Ring. {npc:259118}, {npc:264074} and {npc:264072} stand in the camp."] = "Forever 里这些旧任务任何等级都足额给分。{faction:81}西北{area:17045}上的大地之环营地：20分钟300点{faction:81}声望，另外各100点给{zone:1454}和暗矛巨魔，还有450点大地之环。{npc:259118}、{npc:264074}和{npc:264072}站在营地里。",
	["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. {area:221}, at the south end of {zone:1412}: about 1,100 {faction:81} reputation in 25 minutes. Starting-zone quests give the other cities no share. {npc:2980} and {npc:2981} stand in the camp, {npc:3209} at its edge."] = "Forever 里这些旧任务任何等级都足额给分。{zone:1412}南端的{area:221}：25分钟约1,100点{faction:81}声望。新手区的任务不分给其他城市。{npc:2980}和{npc:2981}站在营地，{npc:3209}在边缘。",
	["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. {area:222} and eastern {zone:1412}: about 1,000 {faction:81} reputation in 45 minutes. {npc:2993} stands in the middle of the village; {npc:2947}, {npc:2985} and {npc:3222} close by; {npc:2988} waits east of the village by the road."] = "Forever 里这些旧任务任何等级都足额给分。{area:222}和{zone:1412}东部：45分钟约1,000点{faction:81}声望。{npc:2993}站在村子中间；{npc:2947}、{npc:2985}和{npc:3222}就在附近；{npc:2988}在村子以东的路边等着。",
	["From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before {npc:14728} offers the {item:14047} donation, and {quest:7825} needs the {item:14047} donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, {item:14047} 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey."] = "接下来靠交布。必须先交完毛料、丝绸和魔纹布，{npc:14728}才会开放{item:14047}捐献，而{quest:7825}又要求先完成{item:14047}捐献。可在拍卖行买布，也可自行刷取：人型生物会掉落，15到25级掉毛料，25到40级掉丝绸，40到50级掉魔纹布，50级及以上掉{item:14047}。60级时刷52级或更高的怪物：更低的已是灰色。",
	["Galak Centaur"] = "加拉克半人马",
	["Galak Outrunner"] = "加拉克斥候",
	["Gloomrise Hatchling"] = "幽谷雏龙",
	["Gloomrise Soldier"] = "幽谷士兵",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}, fewer if you also hand in {item:11040}. {area:1584} pays too: Disharmony of Flame and Disharmony of Fire from Thunderheart at {area:340} ({npc:9017}, 150 in full)."] = "从尊敬到崇敬需要12,000点：交还240次，共4,800块 {item:14047}；如果也交还 {item:11040}，则会更少。{area:1584} 也能提供声望：{area:340} 的桑德哈特提供“不和谐的烈焰”和“不和谐的火焰”（{npc:9017}，全额150点）。",
	["In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. The Earthen Ring camp on the {area:17045}, north-west of {faction:81}: 300 {faction:81} reputation in 20 minutes (60 at a fifth), plus 100 each for {zone:1454} and the Darkspear Trolls and 450 Earthen Ring. {npc:259118}, {npc:264074} and {npc:264072} stand in the camp."] = "经典旧世里，比你低6级以上的任务奖励的声望会减少（60级时只剩五分之一）；有无限测试服报告称它们全额支付。第一次交任务就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。{faction:81}西北方{area:17045}上的大地之环营地：20分钟刷300点{faction:81}声望（五分之一时60点），外加{zone:1454}和暗矛巨魔各100点，以及450点大地之环声望。{npc:259118}、{npc:264074}和{npc:264072}都在营地里。",
	["In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. {area:221}, at the south end of {zone:1412}: about 1,100 {faction:81} reputation in 25 minutes (220 at a fifth). Starting-zone quests give the other cities no share. {npc:2980} and {npc:2981} stand in the camp, {npc:3209} at its edge."] = "经典旧世里，比你低6级以上的任务奖励的声望会减少（60级时只剩五分之一）；有无限测试服报告称它们全额支付。第一次交任务就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。{zone:1412}南端的{area:221}：25分钟约刷1,100点{faction:81}声望（五分之一时220点）。新手区的任务不给其他主城分成。{npc:2980}和{npc:2981}在营地里，{npc:3209}在营地边缘。",
	["In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. {area:222} and eastern {zone:1412}: about 1,000 {faction:81} reputation in 45 minutes (200 at a fifth). {npc:2993} stands in the middle of the village; {npc:2947}, {npc:2985} and {npc:3222} close by; {npc:2988} waits east of the village by the road."] = "经典旧世里，比你低6级以上的任务奖励的声望会减少（60级时只剩五分之一）；有无限测试服报告称它们全额支付。第一次交任务就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。{area:222}和{zone:1412}东部：45分钟约刷1,000点{faction:81}声望（五分之一时200点）。{npc:2993}站在村子中央；{npc:2947}、{npc:2985}和{npc:3222}就在附近；{npc:2988}在村子东边的路旁等你。",
	["Mageweave: the Jadefire satyrs in southern {zone:1448} and the Dunemaul ogres in {zone:1446} drop it about one kill in three, or buy it."] = "魔纹布：{zone:1448} 南部的碧火萨特和 {zone:1446} 的砂槌食人魔大约每击杀三只掉落一次，也可以购买。",
	["Nearly every beast, plant and silithid in the crater drops {quest:3761}, about one kill in three (the Bloodpetals and the Gorishi wasps about one in two), and the dirt mounds give it too. Take far more than 20: every casing uses 2, about 18 for each {item:11040} hand-in."] = "环形山里几乎所有野兽、植物和异种虫都会掉落{quest:3761}，约三只出一个（血瓣花和格里什飞虫约两只出一个），土堆也会提供。不要只拿20个，要多拿很多：每个壳消耗2个，每次交还{item:11040}约消耗18个。",
	["Palemane Poacher"] = "白鬃偷猎者",
	["Palemane Skinner"] = "白鬃剥皮者",
	["Palemane Tanner"] = "白鬃制革者",
	["Reputation · Cities"] = "声望·主城",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. For The Horde! (Rend's head) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city. At Exalted, {npc:3685} in {area:222} sells the kodos to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 kodo, 200 gold for a great kodo at level 60 (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要 21,000 点：交还 420 次，共 8,400 个 {item:14047}。“为部落而战！”（雷德的头颅）和“黑石之王”（奈法利安的头颅）各向所有部落城市提供 200 点。崇拜后，{area:222} 的 {npc:3685} 会向所有部落种族出售科多兽：40 级科多兽 20 金币，60 级大型科多兽 200 金币（无限的价格）；经典旧世中，其他种族需要崇拜才能购买。",
	["Shy-Rotam"] = "害羞的罗塔姆",
	["Silk: the Syndicate in {area:287} and Alterac drop it about one kill in three, or buy it."] = "丝绸：{area:287} 和奥特兰克的辛迪加约每三次击杀掉落一次，也可以购买。",
	["The Skywatcher camp: hand in"] = "观天者 营地：交还任务",
	["The elite shredder Venture Co. Clearcutter works deep inside the mine, beyond where Fizsprocket stood: its key is for {quest:98427}."] = "精英风险投资公司清伐者在矿洞深处作业，就在菲兹斯普罗基特原先待的位置再往里：它的钥匙是给{quest:98427}的。",
	["The mine, the centaurs and the plains"] = "矿洞、半人马与平原",
	["Thunder Bluff Reputation"] = "雷霆崖声望",
	["Ursius"] = "尤尔修斯",
	["Venture Co. Supervisor"] = "风险投资公司监工",
	["Venture Co. Worker"] = "风险投资公司矿工",
	["his donations are handed in from his window and never enter the log"] = "他的捐献任务在他的窗口中直接交还，不会进入任务日志",
	["the {object:2908}"] = "{object:2908}",
	["{area:17044} (optional hub)"] = "{area:17044}（可选任务点）",
	["{area:17044} is the tauren burial ground north of {faction:81}. Use the {item:273015} on the Gnawed Corpses. {npc:264082} waits at the heart of it; her body carries a {item:273658}: read it to start {quest:96294}."] = "{area:17044} 是 {faction:81} 北侧的牛头人墓地。对啃噬过的尸体使用 {item:273015}。{npc:264082} 在墓地中央等待；她的尸体上有一份 {item:273658}：阅读后可开始 {quest:96294}。",
	["{area:221} (optional hub)"] = "{area:221}（可选任务点）",
	["{area:221}: hand in"] = "{area:221}：交任务",
	["{area:221}: last hand-in"] = "{area:221}：最后一次交任务",
	["{area:221}: the Battleboars"] = "{area:221}：斗猪。",
	["{area:222} (optional hub)"] = "{area:222}（可选任务点）",
	["{area:222}: hand in"] = "{area:222}：交任务",
	["{area:222}: last hand-in"] = "{area:222}：最后一次交任务",
	["{area:360}: the Clearcutter"] = "{area:360}：清伐者",
	["{faction:81} reputation comes from quests, {item:11040} and cloth. {npc:14728}, the cloth quartermaster, stands on the central rise among the leatherworkers' and tailors' tents. He takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then {quest:7825}, 20 {item:14047} for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with {faction:81} also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1454}, the {zone:1458} and the Darkspear Trolls. While you level, do {faction:81}'s quests within 5 levels of them: {zone:1412} at 1 to 12, {area:378} and the Crossroads at 13 to 22, {zone:1441} at 25 to 30. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored Thunder Bluff's merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the kodo vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the kodos: 20 gold for a level 40 kodo, 200 gold for a great kodo at level 60, once you have mount training. {faction:81} has no tabard or other reward."] = "{faction:81}声望来自任务、{item:11040}和布料。布匹军需官{npc:14728}站在中央高地的制皮与裁缝帐篷之间。他接收四种一次性捐赠，每种60块布（各150声望），之后可无限重复{quest:7825}，每20块{item:14047}换50声望。每获得一点{faction:81}声望，{zone:1454}、{zone:1458}和暗矛巨魔也会获得四分之一。练级时，应在与任务相差不超过5级时完成{faction:81}的任务：1至12级做{zone:1412}，13至22级做{area:378}和十字路口，25至30级做{zone:1441}。传承特长“外交家”最多增加10%。奖励：尊敬后，雷霆崖商人的售价降低10%（经典旧世规则），包括科多兽商人；崇拜后，其他种族也能购买科多兽：40级科多兽20金币，60级大型科多兽200金币，均需先接受坐骑训练。{faction:81}没有战袍或其他奖励。",
	["{faction:81} reputation comes from quests, {item:11040} and cloth. {npc:14728}, the cloth quartermaster, stands on the central rise among the leatherworkers' and tailors' tents. He takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then {quest:7825}, 20 {item:14047} for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with {faction:81} also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1454}, the {zone:1458} and the Darkspear Trolls. While you level, do {faction:81}'s quests within 5 levels of them: {zone:1412} at 1 to 12, {area:378} and the {area:380} at 13 to 22, {zone:1441} at 25 to 30. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored Thunder Bluff's merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the kodo vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the kodos: 20 gold for a level 40 kodo, 200 gold for a great kodo at level 60, once you have mount training. {faction:81} has no tabard or other reward."] = "{faction:81}声望来自任务、{item:11040}和捐布。布料军需官{npc:14728}站在中央高地的制皮匠与裁缝帐篷之间。他先收四次一次性的60布料捐赠（每次150点），然后是{quest:7825}，20个{item:14047}换50点，想交多少次都行。你在{faction:81}获得的每一点声望，同时以四分之一计入{zone:1454}、{zone:1458}和暗矛巨魔。练级过程中，在任务等级与你相差不超过5级时去做{faction:81}的任务：1到12级在{zone:1412}，13到22级在{area:378}和{area:380}，25到30级在{zone:1441}。传承特长“外交官”最多加成10%。奖励：尊敬后雷霆崖的商人对你打九折（经典旧世规则），科多兽商人也在内；崇拜后其他种族可以购买科多兽：40级科多兽20金，60级巨型科多兽200金，前提是你已学会骑术。{faction:81}没有战袍或其他奖励。",
	["{faction:81}: how it works"] = "{faction:81}：规则说明",
