	["{npc:2982} and the cougars"] = "{npc:2982} 与狮子",
	["{npc:2982} sits on the hill south of the camp; the Mountain Cougars live in those hills."] = "{npc:2982} 坐在营地南边的山上；山狮生活在那些山丘中。",
	["{npc:2985}: {quest:743}, +100"] = "{npc:2985}：{quest:743}，+100",
	["{npc:2988}: {quest:749}, +75"] = "{npc:2988}：{quest:749}，+75",
	["{npc:2991} and the plains"] = "{npc:2991}和平原",
	["{npc:2991}'s tent is south-east of the camp; the water pitcher stands at the well beside it. Plainstriders graze all around."] = "{npc:2991} 的帐篷在营地东南面；水罐在旁边的水井处。陆行鸟在周围各处吃草。",
	["{npc:2993}: {quest:745}, +100"] = "{npc:2993}：{quest:745}，+100",
	["{npc:3209}: {quest:3376}, +200"] = "{npc:3209}：{quest:3376}，+200",
	["{npc:3222}: {quest:99079}, +10"] = "{npc:3222}：{quest:99079}，+10",
	["{npc:3685}: the kodos"] = "{npc:3685}：科多兽。",
	["{npc:5770} stands on {area:1639}, beside {npc:5769}."] = "{npc:5770} 站在 {area:1639}，位于 {npc:5769} 身旁。",
	["{npc:9076} takes the soil. {npc:9087} sells the {item:11020} (1 gold) and Packets of Tharlendris Seeds (10 silver each). With a seed packet and 2 {quest:3761} in your bags, use the pouch: it grows an {item:11024}, once every 10 minutes. Open each casing: about one in three holds 1 to 5 {item:11040}, the rest common herbs. Use the pouch whenever it is ready while you follow the rest of this guide."] = "{npc:9076} 接受泥土。{npc:9087} 出售 {item:11020}（1金币）和萨伦迪斯种子包（每包10银币）。背包中有一包种子和2份 {quest:3761} 时，使用袋子：会长出一个 {item:11024}，每10分钟可用一次。打开每个外壳：约三分之一会装有1到5份 {item:11040}，其余则是普通草药。继续按本指南行动时，只要袋子冷却完成就使用。",
	["{npc:9087} stands on {area:1639}. If your 10 {item:11040} are not ready yet, skip this step and go on with the cloth: the cloth steps below list the {item:11040} hand-in too."] = "{npc:9087} 站在 {area:1639}。如果还没准备好10份 {item:11040}，跳过此步骤，继续交布：下面的布料步骤也列出了 {item:11040} 的交还。",
	["{npc:9087}: {quest:3804}, +50"] = "{npc:9087}：{quest:3804}，+50",
	["{quest:3761}, +100"] = "{quest:3761}，+100",
	["{quest:3782}, +100"] = "{quest:3782}，+100",
	["{quest:3804} takes 10 {item:11040} for 50, as often as you like, and pays in full at 60, but it is slow: the {item:11020} grows one casing every 10 minutes and a casing holds about one {item:11040} on average, so each hand-in takes about 90 minutes of waiting, 18 {quest:3761} and 9 seed packets (90 silver). It runs beside whatever else you do: a little over 30 reputation an hour. The chain before it is level 50 (in Classic a fifth at 60). {npc:6746} sends you to {npc:5769} on {area:1639}; he wants 20 {quest:3761}."] = "{quest:3804}用10个{item:11040}换50点声望，想交多少次都行，60级时也全额支付，但很慢：{item:11020}每10分钟才长出一个外壳，而外壳平均只装约一个{item:11040}，所以每次上缴要约90分钟的等待、18个{quest:3761}和9个种子包（90银）。它可以伴随你做的任何事同时进行：每小时略多于30点声望。它的前置任务链是50级的（经典旧世里60级只剩五分之一）。{npc:6746}让你去{area:1639}找{npc:5769}；他要20个{quest:3761}。",
	["{quest:3804} takes 10 {item:11040} for 50, as often as you like, and pays in full at 60, but it is slow: the {item:11020} grows one casing every 10 minutes and a casing holds about one {item:11040} on average, so each hand-in takes about 90 minutes of waiting, 18 {quest:3761} and 9 seed packets (90 silver). It runs beside whatever else you do: a little over 30 reputation an hour. The chain before it is level 50. {npc:6746} sends you to {npc:5769} on {area:1639}; he wants 20 {quest:3761}."] = "{quest:3804}收10个{item:11040}给50点，可重复，60级足额给，但很慢：{item:11020}每10分钟长一个荚，一个荚平均装约一个{item:11040}，所以每次交付要等约90分钟、18个{quest:3761}和9包种子（90银）。可以和你做别的事并行：一小时三十多点声望。它前面的任务链是50级。{npc:6746}把你派去{area:1639}的{npc:5769}；他要20个{quest:3761}。",
	["{quest:3804}, +50"] = "{quest:3804}，+50",
	["{quest:4882}, +100: to {npc:5770} in {faction:81}"] = "{quest:4882}，+100：交给{faction:81}的{npc:5770}",
	["{quest:5054}, +100"] = "{quest:5054}，+100",
	["{quest:5055}, +100"] = "{quest:5055}，+100",
