	["{area:152} is also where The Key to {area:2057} ends (200), after a longer chain. {npc:10136} in the {faction:68}'s Apothecarium pays about 290 more for oozes from {zone:1448} and {zone:1449}."] = "{area:152}也是“{area:2057}的钥匙”长任务线的终点（200）。{faction:68}炼金房的{npc:10136}还会为{zone:1448}和{zone:1449}的软泥怪任务奖励约290声望。",
	["{area:152} is the Forsaken camp on the road from Tirisfal into the {zone:1422}. {npc:10837}'s chain sends you against the Scourge cauldrons of the {zone:1422}: about 820 {faction:68} reputation, about 710 at 60 if the level 53 quests pay less. Take a {item:12814} from the box beside him; burn the command tent of the Scarlet camp between {area:200} and {area:199} and plant the {item:12807} beside it."] = "{area:152}是从提瑞斯法进入{zone:1422}路上的被遗忘者营地。{npc:10837}的任务链让你对付{zone:1422}的天灾瘟疫锅：约820点{faction:68}声望，如果53级任务减成，60级时约710点。从他身旁的箱子里拿{item:12814}；烧掉{area:200}和{area:199}之间血色营地的指挥帐篷，把{item:12807}插在旁边。",
	["{area:152} is the Forsaken camp on the road from Tirisfal into the {zone:1422}. {npc:10837}'s chain sends you against the Scourge cauldrons of the {zone:1422}: about 820 {faction:68} reputation. Take a {item:12814} from the box beside him; burn the command tent of the Scarlet camp between {area:200} and {area:199} and plant the {item:12807} beside it."] = "{area:152}是从提瑞斯法通往{zone:1422}路上的被遗忘者营地。{npc:10837}的任务链派你去对付{zone:1422}的天灾大锅：约820点{faction:68}声望。从他旁边的箱子里拿一个{item:12814}；烧掉{area:200}和{area:199}之间血色营地指挥帐篷，并在旁边埋下{item:12807}。",
